agre-pā́, a., zuerst trinkend [pā].<BR>-ā́s [N. p. m.] {330,10} (ṛbhavas).<BR>-ā́bhis [I. m.] {330,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0012" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अघ|अघं|अघः
aghá, 1〉 a., schlimm, quällend, ursprünglich wol: bedrängend, würgend, von der in áṃhas u. s. w. erscheinenden Wurzel agh = aṃh, gr. ἀχ, ἀγχ (Cu. 〔166〕). 2〉 n., Noth, Uebel, Unheil.<BR>-ás: 1〉 vṛ́kas {42,2}.<BR>-ám [m.] 1〉 {620,2} neb. agháśaṃsam.<BR>-ám [n.] 1〉 {503,8}. 2〉 {97,1}; {232,11}; {357,7}; {638,14}; {667,1}; {861,3}.<BR>-ā́ya 1〉 {189,5}; 1〉 oder 2〉 {535,7} (parādaí).<BR>-ā́t [n.] 2〉 {166,8}.<BR>-ásya [m.] {688,4}; (〰 cid dvéṣas) {692,5} (yád).<BR>-ásya [n.] 2〉 rákṣas {915,14}.<BR>-ā́s [f.] 1〉 aryás árātayas: {500,8}; {489,16}.<BR>-ā́ni 2〉 {220,5}; {599,5}.<BR>-ā́ [n. p.] 2〉 {928,10}; {667,5}.<BR>-ā́nām 1〉 oder 2〉 {667,2} (apā́kṛtim).<BR>-ā́su 1〉 {911,13} [〰 hanyante gā́vas (?)].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0012" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अघशंस|अघशंसः
aghá-śaṃsa, a., der Unheil sinnt, der Böse.<BR>-as {129,6}; {469,7}; {512,3}; {516,10}; {1011,2}.<BR>-am [m.] {449,5}; {620,2}; {913,20}.<BR>-asya [m.] {42,4}.<BR>-e [m.] {357,7}.<BR>-āya [m.] {620,4}; {1008,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0012" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

