á-jūryat, a., nicht alternd (jū́ryat), von Indra.<BR>-atas [G.] {280,1}; {396,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजोष
á-josa,á-joṣa, a., kein Genüge (jósajóṣa) habend, unersättlich, begierig.<BR>-ās [N. p. f.] gíras {9,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

