án-ṛju, a., un-gerade [ṛjú], unredlich.<BR>-os bhrā́tur {299,13}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0062" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृत|अनृतं
án-ṛta, a., un-wahr, un-recht [ṛtá]; 2〉 unwahrhaftig, unredlich; 3〉 n., Unwahrheit, Lüge, Unrecht.<BR>-am [m.] 2〉 {152,3} (Gegensatz ṛtám); ná 〰 (índram) {671,12}.<BR>-am [n.] 1〉 {105,5} (Gegensatz ṛtám). 3〉 {23,22}; {139,2}; {544,4}; {671,12}; {835,8}; {836,4}; {950,5}.<BR>-ena 3〉 {913,11}.<BR>-asya 1〉 várpasas {926,7}. 3〉 dhāsím {366,4}; cetā́ras {576,5}; sétū {581,3}; sétau {893,4}; prayotā́ {602,6}.<BR>-ās [m.] 2〉 pāpā́sas {301,5}.<BR>-āni 3〉 {152,1}; {226,6}.<BR>-ā [n.] 3〉 {215,6}. _{215,7}; {577,5}; {600,4}.<BR>-ebhis 1〉 vácobhis {620,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0062" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

