(á-nedya), á-nedia, a., untadelig [nedia s. nid].<BR>-a {657,1} (indra).<BR>-as gaṇás mā́rutas {415,13}; {87,4}.<BR>-ās jaritā́ras {460,4}. So auch (für ánedias) zu les. {165,12} (marútas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0062" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

