apasyú, a., geschäftig.<BR>-ávas [m.] vrā́tās {726,2}.<BR>-úbhis manī́ṣíbhis {788,2}.<BR>-úvas [N. f.] {979,1}; uṣásas {79,1}; harítas {750,3}; dhā́rās {768,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

