abhí-dyu, a., dem Himmel [dyú = dív] zustrebend, den Himmel zu erlangen trachtend; 2〉 himmlisch, von den Göttern.<BR>-um (tarutā́ram) {119,10}.<BR>-ave {684,6} (agnáye).<BR>-avas káṇvāsas {47,4}; kīstā́sas {127,7}; índavas {134,2}; vā́jās {261,1}. 2〉 (devā́s) {492,15}; {692,9}; (marútas) {627,25}; {903,3}; {904,4}.<BR>-ubhis priyámedhais {624,20}; vā́jebhis {53,5}. 2〉 gaṇaís índrasya {6,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0083" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

