अमवत्|अमवन्त्
ámavat, a. [von áma], 1〉 ungestüm, mächtig vordringend; 2〉 gewaltig, kräftig, tüchtig; 3〉 -at, adv., ungestüm.<BR>-at 2〉 {52,9} (ukthíam); várūtham {351,4}; śávas {440,3}; {684,13}; kṣatrám {388,9}. 3〉 {412,1}.<BR>-ān 2〉 diaús {52,10}; rā́jā {300,1}; vṛ́ṣā (svanás) {441,5}; mártas {837,7}.<BR>-antas 1〉 (marútas) {38,7}; {640,7}; arcáyas {36,20}.<BR>-atsu 1〉 {507,6}.<BR>-attarebhias 1〉 {902,5} (Presssteine).<BR>-atī 2〉 sātís {168,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

