yónau {785,1}. — 5〉 párva {315,9}.<BR>Stamm d. Intens. álar:<BR>-rṣi 9〉 yudhma {621,7}.<BR>-rti 9〉 dákṣas, manyús {668,8}.<BR>Stamm d. Caus. arpaya:<BR>-a úd 4〉 vīrā́n bheṣajébhis {224,4}.<BR>-atam ní 3〉 tamovṛ́dhas {620,1}.<BR>Part. ṛṇvát (vom Stamm II oder III):<BR>-án 3〉 dhūmám {518,1}.<BR>Part. Perf. ārivás, schwach ārús:<BR>-úṣī 11〉 bhrūṇā́ni {981,2}.<BR>ārāṇá:<BR>-é [du. f.] sam 1〉 {267,2} (die zwei Ströme).<BR>Part. Aor. arāṇá:<BR>-ás sam 3〉 śubhānaís {165,3}.<BR>Part. II. ṛta (ṛtá als selbständiges Nomen s. d.).<BR>-as sám 4〉 skambhás {309,5}.<BR>-am nír 2〉 vándanam {119,7}.<BR>-eṣu sám 1〉 dhvajéṣu {929,11}.<BR>Part. II. d. Caus. arpitá:<BR>-ā́s 10〉 ná śaṅkávas tásmin (cakré) {164,48}.<BR>árpita:<BR>-as 10〉 pūṣā́ bhúvane {499,2}; (sómas) bhúvaneṣu {798,14}. _{798,39}. _{798,45}.<BR>-am 10〉 vicakṣaṇám saptácakre {164,12}; gárbham nā́bhau ádhi {908,6}; jyótis dhárman {996,2}.<BR>-ā [n.] 10〉 tásmin (sū́rie) bhúvanāni {164,14} (wo ā́rpitā steht).<BR>-ā [f.] 10〉 devéṣu hótrā {142,9}.<BR>Absolutiv d. Caus. árpya:<BR>-ya pra‿ 4〉 jágat {113,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर|अरं|अरः
ará, m., Radspeiche, als die eingefügte [ar 10].<BR>-ā́s {412,5}; {904,4}.<BR>-ā́n {32,15}; {141,9}; {367,6}; {686,3}.<BR>-ā́ṇaam {640,14} ná caramás.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

