(ára), a., passend [von ar 10], zu Grunde liegend in áram, vgl. evā́ra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

