अर्वावत्|अर्व्वावत्
arvāvát, f., Nähe [von arva], überall mit dem Gegensatze parāvát.<BR>-átam {274,9}.<BR>-átas [Ab.] {271,11}; {274,8}; {691,1}; {751,5}.<BR>-áti {427,1}; {633,15}; {653,10}; {702,6}; {706,4}; {777,22}; {1022,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

