अवस्यु
avasyú, a., Beistand oder Gunst (der Götter) suchend, von den Sängern oder Betern; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=129" target="_blank">Page129</a>] 2〉 von den Liedern; 3〉 gern helfend (von Göttern); [vom vorigen].<BR>-ús {25,19}; {267,5}; {548,17}; {655,22}—_{655,24}. — 3〉 von Indra {312,11}; {385,10}.<BR>-úm jaritā́ram {429,8}.<BR>-úvam [f.] 3〉 (pratáraṇīm) {400,1}.<BR>-áve {197,6}; brahmáṇe {346,9}.<BR>-avas [V.] {725,2}.<BR>-ávas [m.] {101,1}; {114,11}; {131,3}; {202,12}. _{202,13}; {210,8}; {276,9}; {610,4}; {641,1}; {672,10}; víprās {633,17}; {729,7}; {775,20}; víprāsas {798,24}; manīṣínas {212,5}.<BR>-úvas [N. p. f.] 2〉 gíras {755,2}.<BR>-úbhis {633,9} namovṛdhaís.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0128" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

