अश्रित
á-śrita, a., nicht ausgebreitet, nicht entfaltet, von Agni, sofern er noch im Holze verborgen ruht [śritá S. śri].<BR>-am {303,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रीर
á-śrīrá,a-śrīrá, a., hässlich.<BR>-ás {622,20} jā́mātā.<BR>-ám {469,6}, Gegensatz suprátīkam.<BR>-ā́ [f.] tanū́s {911,30}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रु
áśru, n., die Thräne [von 3. aś], als die scharfe, bittere, wie δάϰρυ von δάϰ-νω. Vielleicht ist jedoch *dáśru auch für das Sanskrit als Grundform anzunehmen und eine an 3. aś sich anlehnende Umdeutung im Spiele.<BR>-u {921,12}. _{921,13}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्व|अश्वः
áśva, m., das Ross, f., áśvā, die Stute, von aś, erreichen, (im Laufe) einholen, wovon auch āśú, schnell. Es ist áśua zu lesen {865,10}; {162,19} und auch {175,4}; {625,35}, falls hier nicht āśúbhis statt áśvais zu lesen ist. — Vgl. die Adj. āśú, vājín, vṛ́ṣan u. s. w., und die Zusammensetzungen an-aśvá u. s. w.<BR>-as {36,8}; {161,3}; {162,22}; {164,2}; {173,3}; {260,3}; {261,14}; {263,6}; {298,8}; {444,4}; {486,26}; {519,2}; {586,1}; {622,2}; {776,3}; {783,6}; {809,28}; {813,2}; {821,10}; {824,4}; {887,24}; {962,5}; {1018,5}.<BR>-am {25,3}; {27,1}; {116,6}; {117,4}. _{117,9}; {118,9}; {161,7}; {162,4}. _{162,13}. _{162,15}; {163,2}; {287,11}. _{287,24}; {306,1}; {333,8}; {335,5}; {353,1}; {487,2}; {523,1}; {587,5}; {593,3}; {634,3}; {637,15}; {683,10}; {687,2}; {706,2}; {712,7}; {721,9}; {773,3}; {774,6}; {776,10}; {799,1}; {801,4}; {806,5}; {820,7}; {844,14}; {865,10}; {891,11}; {894,11}; {923,4}; {933,7}. _{933,10}; {945,1}; {969,1}. _{969,2}; {975,1}; {1014,1}.<BR>-ena {162,3}.<BR>-āya {162,16}; {385,4}; {650,4}; {701,25}.<BR>-āt {161,7}; {899,10}.<BR>-asya durás {53,2}; śíras {84,14}; śīrsṇā́ {116,12}; śaphā́t {116,7}; {117,6}; ménām {121,2}; kravíṣas {162,9}; váṅkrīs _{162,18}; rétas {164,34}. _{164,35}; jánima {226,6}; dhā́rās {437,6}; vrajám {652,5}; paurás {670,6}; bhógam {860,3}; akāriṣam {335,6}. _{335,3}; prá dātu {1021,5}.<BR>-asiā (Pada -asya) viśastā́ {162,19}.<BR>-ā [d.] {174,5}; {269,3}; {329,10}; {330,9}; {500,3}; {508,4}; {620,6}; {848,4}. _{848,5}.<BR>-ayos [L. du.] {488,9}.<BR>-āsas {38,12}; {148,3}; {181,2}; {203,7}; {310,4}; {341,2}; {413,7}; {416,4}; {429,6}; {457,43}; {470,2}; {504,7}; {510,4}; {590,4}; {621,9}; {904,5}; {917,14}; {921,9}.<BR>-ās [m.] {115,3}; {118,5}; {163,10}; {164,3}; {180,1}; {240,8}. _{240,9}; {295,2}; {408,10}; {413,5}; {447,4}; {465,6}; {478,3}; {516,7}; {534,1}; {557,6}; {583,4}; {591,6}; {613,6}; {643,11}; {832,6}; {870,7}; {916,10}; {933,11}; {945,3}.<BR>-ān {416,1}; {437,3}; {550,4}; {677,17}; {684,1}; {809,50}; {860,11}; {905,7}; {927,7}; {975,4}.<BR>-ebhis {570,2}; {606,6}; {625,7}; {633,11}; {666,26}; {696,5}; {934,7}.<BR>-ais {16,9}; {88,2}; {113,14}; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=141" target="_blank">Page141</a>] {117,14} {175,4}; {206,4}; {264,12}. _{264,20}; {292,3}; {347,5}; {583,9}{383,9}; {409,1}; {412,6}; {480,4}; {503,3}; {506,2}; {534,2}; {557,3}; {561,1}; {585,1}; {587,3}; {625,35}; {627,27}; {808,11}; {829,7}; {833,2}; {837,7}; {894,12}; {896,2}. _{896,3}.<BR>-ānām gópatis {101,4}; rásam {620,10}; janitā́ {656,5}; ṣaṣṭím sahásrā {666,29}; (śatám) {1025,4}.<BR>-ānaam pañcāśátam {372,5}; sahásrā {504,10}.<BR>-eṣu {29,1}—_{29,7}; {114,8}.<BR>-e [V. s. f.] {30,21}.<BR>-ā [f.] {348,2}; {901,7}.<BR>-ām {225,6}.<BR>-ayā {819,8}.<BR>-e [du. f.] {267,1}.<BR>-ās [N. p. f.] {235,4}; {241,2}; {407,7}; {790,2}; {921,8}; {923,3}.<BR>-ās [A.] {240,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वघ्न|अश्वघ्नः
(aśva-ghna), m., wohlriechender Oleander, Nerium odorum Ait.; von áśva und ghna, tödtend, weil der Saft giftig ist für Menschen und Thiere. Siehe āśvaghná.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वजित्
aśva-jít, a., Rosse erbeutend.<BR>-ít {771,1} vom Soma.<BR>-íte índrāya {212,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वत्थ|अश्वत्थः
aśvatthá, m., der Feigenbaum, Ficus religiosa L.; für aśva-sthá, also als Standort der Rosse bezeichnet [Ku. 〔1,467〕]. Bildlich wird es für das aus dem Holze dieses Baumes verfertigte Somagefäss gebraucht ({135,8}).<BR>-ám {135,8}.<BR>-é {923,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वथ
aśvathá, m., Eigenname eines Mannes; ursprünglich wol dem vorigen gleich.<BR>-ás {488,24}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वदा
aśva-dā́, a., Rosse schenkend.<BR>-ā́s [N. p. m.] {933,2}; maghávānas {396,8}.<BR>-ā́s [A. p. f.] uṣásas {113,18}.<BR>-ā́taras mártias {683,15}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वदावन्
aśva-dāvan, a., dass.<BR>-an [V.] {372,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वनिर्णिज्
áśva-nirṇij, a., mit Rossen geschmückt, von schönen Rossen umgeben [nirṇíj, Schmuck, Prachtgewand].<BR>-iji {902,3} tvāṣṭré.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वपति|अश्वपतिः
aśva-pati, m., Herr der Rosse [páti].<BR>-e [V.] {641,3} von Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वपर्ण|अश्वपर्ण्ण
áśva-parṇa, a., dem die Rosse als Fittige [parṇá] dienen.<BR>-ās náras {488,31} v. den Marutʼs.<BR>-ais ráthebhis {88,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

