áśveṣita, a., von Rossen [áśva] getrieben oder gezogen [iṣitá s. 1. iṣ].<BR>-am [n.] ájma {666,28}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्व्य|अश्व्यः
áśvya (nur {337,10}; {666,22}; {913,16}; sonst immer) áśvia, zum Rosse gehörig; 2〉 aus Rossen bestehend; 3〉 n., Rossbesitz, Schar von Rossen.<BR>-as vā́ras {32,12}; upabdis {74,7}; mṛkṣás {675,3}.<BR>-am [m.] 1〉 ūrvám {324,5}; vrajám {820,6}. — 2〉 paśúm {415,5}; {654,16}.<BR>-am [n.] 1〉 śíras {117,22}; {119,9}; saṃvánanam {919,12}. — 2〉 rā́dhas {406,17}; {608,3}. — 3〉 {641,10}; {784,9}.<BR>-ena 2〉 paśúnā {913,16}.<BR>-asya 3〉 {337,10}; {666,22}.<BR>-e [L.] vásau {633,22}.<BR>-ā 2〉 maghā́ni {583,9}; maghā́ {532,10}; rā́dhāṃsi {433,7}; sahásrā {654,14}. — 3〉 {647,6}.<BR>-āni 1〉 śīrṣā́ni {534,19}. — 2〉 rā́dhāṃsi {485,12}.<BR>-ais 2〉 vasavyàis {501,14}; sahásrebhis {682,14}. _{682,15}.<BR>-ānaam 2〉 hárīṇaam {645,23}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

