a-sinvá, a., un-ersättlich.<BR>-ám [m.], vavrám {386,8}.<BR>-ā́ [f.] hetís {915,12}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0154" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

