अस्था
asthā́ scheint Adverb, etwa „sogleich“ (also wol Instr. fem. von a-sthā́).<BR>{874,10}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0159" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्थूरि|अस्थूरिः
