इरिन्
írin, a., gewaltthätig, substantivisch: Zwingherr [die Abstammung siehe bei íras].<BR>-ī {441,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0220" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इर्य|इर्य्य
írya, íria, a., regsam, rüstig, kräftig [s. unter iras].<BR>-ias gopā́s {529,3}; {661,4}.<BR>-yam pūṣáṇam {495,8}.<BR>-iam rā́jānam {412,4}.<BR>-yā [du. m.] {932,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0220" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इरिअ
írya, íria, a., regsam, rüstig, kräftig [s. unter iras].<BR>-ias gopā́s {529,3}; {661,4}.<BR>-yam pūṣáṇam {495,8}.<BR>-iam rā́jānam {412,4}.<BR>-yā [du. m.] {932,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0220" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

