इषण्य्
√iṣaṇy, zur Eile antreiben, herbeitreiben, anregen [von iṣáṇi].<BR>Mit sám, jemandem [D.] etwas [A., Vieh] zusammentreiben.<BR>Stamm iṣaṇya:<BR>-asi nas (vāvṛdhádhyai) {925,1}.<BR>-ati vām {642,4} (Subj. anyád cakrám).<BR>-anti (vā́riam) {360,6}.<BR>-a sám: gā́s nas {284,3}.<BR>-ata mā́rutam gaṇám {406,14}.<BR>Part. iṣaṇyát:<BR>-n {295,7}; gā́s {808,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषण्या
