इह
ihá, hier, hierher, nun [vom Deutestamme i].<BR>1〉 hier: {24,11}; {28,5}; {35,1}; {36,2}; {37,3}; {38,15}; {42,7}; {45,1}; {76,2}; {92,14}; {94,16}; {106,4}; {110,1}; {113,7}. _{113,12}; {121,8}; {135,6}; {177,4}; {191,7}; {224,15}; {226,13}; {228,5}; {232,4}. _{232,21}; {233,2}; {243,2}; {246,3}; {248,7}; {285,7}. _{285,8}; {286,5}; {291,5}; {294,6}. _{294,7}; {298,2}; {300,9}; {303,1}; ….<BR>2〉 hierher: {1,2}; {12,3}. _{12,10}; {13,3}. _{13,10}; {14,12}; {15,4}; {16,2}; {21,1}. _{21,4}; {22,1}. _{22,9}. _{22,10}. _{22,12}; {34,11}; {44,7}; {45,9}; {74,6}; {76,2}; {89,7}; {92,18}; {134,1}; {135,5}; {142,4}; {181,2}; {183,6}; {186,6}; {188,6}; {227,4}; {236,5}; {237,5}; {292,5}; {304,2}; ….<BR>3〉 nun: {35,6}; {161,3}; {164,7}. _{164,18}. _{164,49}; {185,11}; {288,5}; {301,14}; ….<BR>4〉 ihá‿iha, hier und dort, an vielen Orten: {294,1}; {384,10}; {401,5}; {575,11}; {957,2}; jetzt und jetzt = wiederholt: {181,4}; {339,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0229" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

