(ukṣaṇyā́yana), ukṣaṇiā́yana, m., Nachkomme des ukṣaṇya [von ukṣán].<BR>-e [L.] {645,22}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0245" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्षणिआयन
(ukṣaṇyā́yana), ukṣaṇiā́yana, m., Nachkomme des ukṣaṇya [von ukṣán].<BR>-e [L.] {645,22}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0245" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्षण्यु
