उक्षन्
ukṣán, m., 1〉 der Stier, Bulle, als der beträufelnde [1. ukṣ], seinen Samen ergiessende; 2〉 bildlich von den Göttern {105,10}; {241,7}; namentlich von der Sonne {401,3}, dem Agni {146,2}; {241,6}; {857,8}; {948,4}, Soma {781,4}; {783,9}; {795,3}; {801,3}; {797,10}; {798,43}; {807,4}, den Marutʼs {64,2}; {168,2}; {406,3}; dem Sturme (?) {352,1}; {627,26}; 3〉 die Stiere als Gespanne der Morgenröthe {505,5}; {595,1}; des Vayu {135,9}. Vgl. die Adj. ṛṣvá, paruṣá, puruvā́ra, mahát, rúśat, śvetá, syandrá.<BR>-ā́ 2〉 {146,2}; {241,6}; {352,1}; {401,3}; {781,4}; {783,9}; {795,3}; {801,3}; {857,8}.<BR>-ā́ṇam 1〉 pṛ́śnim {164,43}.<BR>-áṇam 2〉 {797,10}; {798,43}; {807,4} giriṣṭhā́m (aṃśúm); {948,4}.<BR>-ṇás [G.] 2〉 rándhram {627,26}.<BR>-áṇas [N. p.] 1〉 {381,5}; {457,47}; {621,33}; {917,14}; {1024,2}. — 2〉 {168,2}; {406,3}; {64,2}; {105,10}; {241,7}. — 3〉 {135,9}.<BR>-áṇas [A.] 1〉 {912,13}.<BR>-ṇás [A.] 1〉 {854,11}; {912,14}.<BR>-ábhis 1〉 {139,10}; {198,5}. — 3〉 {505,5}; {595,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0245" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्षान्न
ukṣā́nna, a., Stiere [ukṣán] zur Speise [anna] habend, Stiere verzehrend.<BR>-āya agnáye {663,11}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0245" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

