उच्
√uc, etwas [A.] gern thun, gern haben.<BR>Mit ní, an etwas [A., L.] Gefallen finden.<BR>sám, Behagen finden an [I.].<BR>Stamm ucya:<BR>-asi sám: sū́ryasya raśmíbhis {435,4}.<BR>Perf. stark uvóc (betont {520,3}; {553,3}):<BR>-citha daiṣṇám {553,3}.<BR>-ca [3. s.] ní gṛ́bham paúruṣeyīm {520,3}; asmin (ándhasi) {537,1}. — sám ándhasā {536,4}.<BR>Perf. schwach ūc:<BR>-ciṣé [2. s. med.] píbā dadhṛ́g yáthā‿ūciṣé (Pad. ociṣé) {691,2}.<BR>-ce [3. s.] mit Inf. pṛché vām {866,5}.<BR>Part. Perf. ūcivás, ūcús:<BR>-úṣe {103,4}; {859,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0247" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

