ऊर्मि|ऊर्मिः|ऊर्म्मि|ऊर्म्मिः
ūrmí, m., die Welle, Woge, als die sich wälzende, rollende [von *var, wälzen, Cu. 〔527〕]; dazu die Gen. apā́m, síndhos, mádhvas, ghṛtásya, aṃśós, und die Adj. mádhumat, ghṛtaprús, svādú, śukrá, indrapā́na u. s. w.<BR>-ís {207,5}; {267,13}; {354,1}; {488,14}; {634,10}; {684,9}; {776,11}; {790,2}; {792,5}; {798,40}; {820,5}; {822,11}; {974,5}.<BR>-ím {95,10}; {281,1}; {353,2}; {354,11}; {458,12}; {563,1}. _{563,2}. _{563,4}; {756,1}; {761,1}; {798,8}; {800,5}; {808,7}. _{808,8}. _{808,19}; {856,2}. _{856,3}. _{856,7}—_{856,9}; {949,2}; {1028,3}.<BR>-iṇā {780,8}; {786,5}; {788,3}; {798,13}. _{798,25}; {818,10}; {819,15}.<BR>-iā́ [I., wie vom fem.] {184,2}.<BR>-és [G.] síndhos 〰 íva svanás {762,1}.<BR>-aú {726,1}; {784,7}; {785,2}.<BR>-ā́ [L. vor u, v, m] {27,6}; {724,3}; {733,3}; {751,4}; {797,10}.<BR>-áyas {44,12}; {52,7}; {168,2}; {354,6}; {485,20}; {505,1}; {612,5}; {712,11}; {719,8}; {745,1}; {773,5}; {793,1}; {798,2}; {807,3}; {894,1}.<BR>-ī́n {315,5}.<BR>-íbhis {95,10}; {267,2}; {354,7}; {502,2}; {890,9}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0275" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्मिन्|ऊर्म्मिन्
