ऊर्म्या
(ū́rmyā), ū́rmiā, f., 1〉 der Nachthimmel (als wogendes, wallendes Meer aufgefasst); 2〉 die Nacht [ū́rmya, wallend, wogend, VS.], also von ūrmí.<BR>-e [V.] 2〉 {415,17} (devi); {953,6}.<BR>-āyās [G.] 1〉 oder 2〉 támas {451,4}; {506,2}.<BR>-ās [N.] 1〉 {705,1}.<BR>-ās [A.] 1〉 {195,3}.<BR>-āsu 1〉 {489,6} (śyāvā́su).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0276" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्मिआ
