ऋजुगाथ
ṛju-gātha, a., richtig singend [gāthá, Gesang].<BR>-a [V.] {398,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0279" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

