ऋतुपा
ṛtu-pā́, a., zur regelmässigen Opferzeit trinkend.<BR>-ās [V. s.] indra {281,3}.<BR>-ā́s [N. s. m.] agnís {254,4}; {366,3}; v. Indra (?) {925,10}.<BR>-ā́bhis [f.] gnā́s-pátnībhis {330,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0288" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

