कन्या
kanyā̀, kaníā, f., die erste Form nur {768,3} (in {354,9} kaníās va zu lesen), die Jungfrau, besonders häufig die als Braut geschmückte, dem Bräutigam zugeführte.<BR>-íā {123,10}; {161,5}; {267,10}; {490,7} (sárasvatī); {700,1}; {933,10}.<BR>-yā̀ {768,3}.<BR>-íās [N. p.] {354,9}.<BR>-ī́nām jārás {66,8}; jārám {152,4}; pátim {116,10}; bhágas {163,8}; apagohám {206,7}; nā́ma gúhiam {357,2}.<BR>-íāsu {779,10}—_{779,12} (Töchter).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0313" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

