कलश|कलशः
kaláśa, m., Krug, Topf, Becher [gr. ϰάλυξ, ϰύλιξ, wahrscheinlich vom Einhüllen, Einschliessen benannt; vgl. ϰαλύπτω, lat. celare, occulo, (oquoltod)]; 2〉 Eigenname eines Mannes. Adj. ā́pūrṇa, somadhā́na, níkhāta, góbhis aktá; Gen. híraṇyasya, sutásya.<BR>-a 2〉 {858,9}.<BR>-as {266,15}; {510,6}.<BR>-am {117,12}; {323,5}; {774,19}; {786,8}; {798,11}; {809,4}. _{809,33}; {818,7}.<BR>-asya rājasi {993,1}.<BR>-e {488,6}; {775,3}. _{775,13}; {779,15}; {784,1}; {797,5}. _{797,7}; {798,16}. _{798,22}; {805,2}; {808,9}. _{808,14}. _{808,24}; {809,22}.<BR>-ā [d.] somadhā́nā {510,2} (índrāvíṣṇū).<BR>-ās {777,14}.<BR>-ān {772,3}; {787,3}; {793,2}; {798,19}; {800,6}; {804,6}; {808,22}; {818,12}; {993,3}.<BR>-eṣu {720,6}; {724,5}; {729,4}; {730,7}; {779,14}; {780,9}; {796,4}; {798,6}. _{798,9}. _{798,35}. _{798,47}; {808,23}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0317" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

