काश्
√kāś, nur im Intensiv: hell leuchten.<BR>Mit abhí, beschauen.<BR>áva, erblicken.<BR>prá, überschauen.<BR>ví 1〉 strahlen; 2〉 erschauen, wahrnehmen.<BR>Stamm des Int. cākaś:<BR>-śīmi abhí: ghṛtásya dhā́rās {354,5}. _{354,9}.<BR>-śīti abhí (píppalam) {164,20}. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=325" target="_blank">Page325</a>]<BR>Imperf. acākaś:<BR>-śam abhí: dhī́ram {912,19}; cárantam {961,2}.<BR>Part. cā́kaśat:<BR>-at [m.] ava: dhénās {652,22}; {869,6}; ubhé (erg. ródasī) {744,4}; víśvā rūpā́ {962,4}. — pra: bhúvanāni {349,4}. — vi 1〉 {24,10} (candrámās). — 2〉 gṛhám-gṛham {700,2}; dā́sam, ā́riam {912,19}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0324" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

