गमिष्ठ
gámiṣṭha, a., aufs beste, d. h. aufs hülfreichste kommend [von gám s. gam].<BR>-ā [d.] aśvínā {430,2}; aśvinā práti‿ávartim^1 〰 {118,3}; {292,3}.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260112. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/1794.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गम्भर
