गूर्तश्रवस्
gūrtá-śravas, a., dessen Ruhm [śrávas] hoch gepriesen wird [gūrtá].<BR>-ās śū́ras (índras) {122,10}.<BR>-asam vīrám (índram) {61,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

