गृह|गृहं|गृहः
gṛhá, m. [von grabh, grah], 1〉 der Diener (als der, welcher ergreift und zur Hand reicht); 2〉 Haus (als das in sich fassende), die Wohnstätte [vgl. gṛbhá]. — Adj. mṛnmáya, Gen. somínas, dāśúṣas, sunvatás, yájvanas, víprasya, ágohiasya, tváṣṭur, candrámasas, samudrásya.<BR>-ás 1〉 {945,13}.<BR>-ám 2〉 {22,4}; {49,1}; {110,2}; {135,7}; {232,2}; {345,3}; {383,9}; {469,6}; {590,4}; {604,5}; {605,1}; {633,10}; {642,3}; {678,7}; {682,7}; {694,6}; {761,2}; {842,10}; {848,6}; {866,3}. _{866,11}. _{866,14}; {911,10}; {912,22}; {997,2}.<BR>-ám-gṛham 2〉 {123,4}; {124,11}; {700,2}.<BR>-ā́ya 2〉 {140,12}.<BR>-ā́t 2〉 {534,21}. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=407" target="_blank">Page407</a>]<BR>-é 2〉 {13,12}; {84,15}; {161,11}; {191,10}; {287,6}; {294,5}; {299,4}; {314,3}; {342,6}; {345,6}; {630,1}; {639,11}; {642,8}; {646,17}; {651,4}; {812,2}. _{812,8}; {888,4}; {911,27}. _{911,42}; {926,6}; {948,5}; {1012,3}.<BR>-é-gṛhe 2〉 {28,5}; {71,4}; {365,4}; {917,2}.<BR>-ā́s 2〉 {430,4}; {968,8}.<BR>-ā́sas 2〉 {844,12}.<BR>-ā́n 2〉 {495,2}; {911,26}; {912,20}.<BR>-ébhyas 2〉 {120,8}; {287,20}.<BR>-ā́nām 2〉 dakṣiṇatás {233,3}.<BR>-éṣu 2〉 {991,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहपति|गृहपतिः
