गोअग्र
(gó-agra), gáv-agra, a., wobei Rinder, Kūhe, Milch u. s. w. [s. go] an der Spitze [ágra] stehen, das Vornehmste sind.<BR>-ān vā́jān {92,7}.<BR>-ām rātím {192,16}.<BR>-ayā prámatyā {53,5}; suṣṭutī́ {783,8}.<BR>-ās [A.] dhíyas {90,5}; śurúdhas {169,8}; íṣas {480,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

