घोर|घोरं|घोरः
ghorá, a., 1〉 furchtbar, grausig, vgl. ghorácakṣas und ághoracakṣus; daher 2〉 scheueinflössend, ehrfurchtgebietend; 3〉 n., das grauenerregende Werk, Zauberwerk.<BR>-ás (índras) {544,2}.<BR>-ám [m.] 2〉 (índram) {203,5}; áśvam (sómam) {801,4}.<BR>-ám [n.] 2〉 mánas (índrasya) {536,6}.<BR>-éṇa [n.] 3〉 {860,14}.<BR>-ásya 2〉 (agnés) {302,6}.<BR>-ā́ [d.] 2〉 (mitrā́váruṇā) {508,4}.<BR>-ā́s 2〉 (marútas) {167,4}; áṅgirasas {934,10}.<BR>-ā́sas 2〉 {918,3}; (ādityā́s) {582,13}.<BR>-ā́ṇām 2〉 (marútām) {169,7}.<BR>-e [V. f.] 2〉 jāye {921,1}.<BR>-ā́ [f.] 1〉 sámṛtis {312,17}. — 2〉 sárasvatī {502,7}.<BR>-áyā 2〉 púraṃdhiā {701,15}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

