cárcara, a., vielleicht: sich weit erstreckend, lang [von car, vgl. carācará].<BR>-am jā́ram {932,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्मन्|चर्म्मन्
cárman, n., abgezogene Haut, Fell, Decke von Fell; 2〉 sasásya 〰, Decke des Ruhekissens (barhís).<BR>-a {85,5}; {309,4}; {439,1}; {579,1}; {626,5}. — 2〉 {239,6}.<BR>-aṇas [Ab.] {110,8}; {161,7}; {294,2}; {332,4}.<BR>-an [L.] 2〉 {301,7}.<BR>-aṇī [d.] {449,3}.<BR>-āṇi mlātā́ni {1024,3} (gegerbte Felle).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्मम्ना|चर्म्मम्ना
