jānuṣa [von janus], enthalten in sahá-jānuṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0483" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

