(jinva), a., fördernd, erregend [von jinv], in dhiyaṃ-jinvá, viśva-jinva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0489" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिव्रि|जिव्रिः
jívri, a., gebrechlich, alt, greis [nach BR. aus 3. jar mit Suffix vi durch Umstellung der Liquidae entstanden].<BR>-is taugriás {180,5}.<BR>-im práskaṇvam {1020,2}.<BR>-es pitúr {70,10}.<BR>-ī [d.] {911,27}; pitárā {110,8}; {332,3}.<BR>-ayas {315,2} (jívrayas ná devā́s); {665,20} ā́ tvā rambhám ná 〰 rārabhmā́.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0489" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

