जीराश्व
jīrā́śva, jīráaśva, a., muntere, rasche [jīrá] Rosse [áśva] habend. Die zusammengezogene Form (jīrā́śva) kommt nur einmal ({195,2}) vor.<BR>-as hótā (agnís) {141,12}; aratís (agnís) {195,2}; ráthas {157,3}.<BR>-am rátham {119,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0491" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीरअश्व
jīrā́śva, jīráaśva, a., muntere, rasche [jīrá] Rosse [áśva] habend. Die zusammengezogene Form (jīrā́śva) kommt nur einmal ({195,2}) vor.<BR>-as hótā (agnís) {141,12}; aratís (agnís) {195,2}; ráthas {157,3}.<BR>-am rátham {119,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0491" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

