जेन्य
(jénya), jénia, a. [von jan], edel, von hoher Abkunft; 2〉 herrlich, vorzüglich (von Gütern).<BR>-as von Agni: {71,4}; {146,5}; {355,5}; viśpátis {128,7}; vṛ́ṣā {140,2}; {209,2}.<BR>-am [m.] vājínam {130,6}; śíśum {798,36} (sómam); {830,3} (agním).<BR>-am [n.] 2〉 vásu {196,1}; {710,6}.<BR>-asya śárdhatas {483,4}; asya {887,24}.<BR>-ā [f.] yóṣā {119,5}; gaús {265,11}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0499" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

