तपुस्
tápus, a., n. [von tap], 1〉 a., glühend, heiss; 2〉 n., Glut.<BR>-us 2〉 neben aghám {503,8}; {620,2} (〰 yayastu carús agnivā́n iva).<BR>-uṣā [I.] 1〉 áśnā {221,4}; cakríyā {225,9}. — 2〉 {643,14}.<BR>-uṣas [G.] 2〉 〰 budhné {273,3}.<BR>-ūṃṣi 1〉 vṛjinā́ni {493,2}. — 2〉 {300,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0524" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

