tárūṣas, a. [von tar], Sieg verleihend, vgl. tárutra 3.<BR>-asā raayā́ (Text rāyā́) {129,10}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0531" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्मन्|तर्म्मन्
