तर्ह्
√tarh, zerschmettern, zermalmen, zerquetschen.<BR>Stamm tṛṃhá:<BR>-át kū́ṭam sma 〰 abhímātim eti {928,4}, wo man das Part. tṛṃhán erwarten sollte.<BR>Perf. tatarha:<BR>(-a) [3. s.] ásurān AV. 11,5,7.<BR>Part. II. tṛḍhá:<BR>-ā́s [N. p. m.] amítrās {133,1}.<BR>-ā́ [p. n.] rákṣāṃsi {457,48}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0531" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

