turī́ya, a., der vierte [für *caturī́ya von catúr].<BR>-a [V.] āditya {1021,7}.<BR>-as (pátis) {911,40}; dṛ́tis {341,1}.<BR>-am [m.] tvā (draviṇodā́m) {15,10}; dātā́ram {623,24}.<BR>-am [n.] padám {164,45}; pā́tram {228,4}; nā́ma {689,9}; dhā́ma {808,19}; ukthám {893,1}.<BR>-eṇa bráhmaṇā {394,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0542" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

