turphári, a., sättigend (?) [von tṛph = tṛp].<BR>-ī [d.] naitośā́ {932,6}; bhágevitā {932,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0542" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

