तृप्ति|तृप्तिः
tṛ́pti, f., Sättigung, Befriedigung (beim Trunke).<BR>-is {825,10}.<BR>-im {691,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0549" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्र|तृप्रः
tṛprá, a., sich unruhig bewegend, gärend (?) [von trap?].<BR>-ā́s {622,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0549" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्
√tṛṣ [Cu. 〔241〕], 1〉 dürsten, von Menschen und Thieren; 2〉 (nach Wasser) lechzen, vom dürren Erdreich; 3〉 lechzen, begierig sein. Causativ: dürsten lassen.<BR>Stamm I. tṛṣ [s. Part.].<BR>Stamm II. tṛ́ṣya [s. Part.].<BR>Perf. schwach tātṛṣ:<BR>-ṣús 1〉 {841,9}.<BR>Aor. Caus. atītṛṣa:<BR>-āma vas {330,11}.<BR>Part. Me. tṛṣāṇá [Stamm I.]:<BR>-ás 1〉 váṃsagas {390,1}; (índras) {653,2}.<BR>-ā́ [d.] 1〉 gaurā́ {585,6}.<BR>-ā́n 2〉 ájrān {315,7} (neb. dhánvāni).<BR>Part. tṛ́syattṛ́ṣyat [Stamm II.]:<BR>-an 1〉 gaurás {624,3}; ṛ́śyas {624,10}.<BR>-antam 1〉 {415,7}.<BR>-ate 1〉 {116,9}; {175,6}.<BR>-atas [G.] 1〉 {688,5} (kā́mam).<BR>Part. Perf. Me. tātṛṣāṇá (tatṛṣāṇá in {456,5}):<BR>-ás 1〉 {195,6}; {456,5} (ghṛṇé ná). — 3〉 {31,7} (agnís).<BR>-ám 1〉 {130,8}; {173,11}.<BR>Part. II. tṛṣitá (durstig):<BR>-ás 1〉 gaurás {16,5}.<BR>Verbale (tṛ́ṣ)<BR>als f., Durst, s. BR.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0550" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषु
tṛ́ṣú, a., gierig, lechzend, verlangend, insbesondere 2〉 n., -ú, adverbial dass.<BR>-úm {303,11} (vā́tam) dūtám kṛṇute.<BR>-ú 2〉 {58,2}. _{58,4}; {303,11}; {519,4}; {905,5}; {917,7}; {939,8}; {941,6}.<BR>-únā-úṇā {303,11}.<BR>-vī́m prásitim {300,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0550" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषुच्यवस्
tṛṣu-cyávas, a., sich voll Gier (voll Verlangen nach Speise) bewegend [cyavas].<BR>-asas [N. p. f.] juhúas agnés {507,10}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0550" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषुच्युत्
tṛṣu-cyút, a., dass. [cyút von cyu].<BR>-útam {140,3} śíśum (agním).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0550" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्ट
tṛṣṭá, a., 1〉 rauh, kratzend; 2〉 von der Stimme: rauh, heiser. [Es könnte auf ein nicht belegbares *tṛś zurückführen; dann würden lit. trászku, rasseln, tarszkinti, klappern, trenkiù, schmettern, stossen, heftig schlagen, lett. traks, wild, toll verglichen werden].<BR>-ám [n.] 1〉 neben káṭukam {911,34} (wo Aufr. triṣṭám hat); {243,3} (wenn es das Beissende des Rauches nach BR. bezeichnet). — 2〉 vācás {913,13}.<BR>-ā́s 2〉 śapáthās {913,15}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0550" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्टामा
tṛṣṭā́mā, f., Eigenname eines Flusses [von tṛṣṭá und áma, Andrang].<BR>-ayā {901,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0550" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्णज्
tṛṣṇáj, a., durstig [von tṛ́ṣṇā, tṛṣ].<BR>-ájam mṛgám {105,7}.<BR>-áje {411,1}; gótamāya {85,11}.<BR>-ájas [N. p. m.] {549,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0550" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

