तृष्यावत्|तृष्यावन्त्
tṛṣyā́vat, a., durstig [von einem Subst. tṛṣyā = tṛ́ṣṇā, Durst] vgl. tarṣyā́vat.<BR>-atas [A.] {619,3} neben uśatás.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0551" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

