तेजस्
téjas, n. [von tij], 1〉 Schneide (des Messers, der Axt); 2〉 Hitze; 3〉 Eifer, Kraft.<BR>-as 1〉 śíśīta 〰 {444,5}. — 2〉 {71,8}.<BR>-asā 1〉 {449,5}; {456,19} tigména. — 3〉 {56,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0551" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजिष्ठ
téjiṣṭha, a., Superl. von tíj [vgl. tigmá], 1〉 sehr scharf; 2〉 sehr heiss; 3〉 sehr glänzend.<BR>-ais 3〉 bhānúbhis {829,5}.<BR>-ā [I. f.?] 2〉 ergänze etwa tapaní {453,3}.<BR>-ayā [I. f.] 1〉 vartanī́ {53,8}. — 2〉 tapanī́ {214,14}.<BR>-ās 3〉 apás {782,2}.<BR>-ābhis 2〉 aráṇibhis {127,4}; {129,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0551" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजीयस्
