dabhrá, a. [von dabh], 1〉 gering, geringfügig; 2〉 wenig, meist mit dem Gegensatze bhū́ri ({328,20}; {864,4}), bhū́yas ({31,6}; {598,6}), bahú ({321,5}); 3〉 n., Dürftigkeit; 4〉 n. Adv., wenig, schwach.<BR>-ám [n.] 1〉 kṛtám {665,32}. — 2〉 {328,20}. — 3〉 {620,10} (〰 etu). — 4〉 {113,5} (〰 páśyadbhyas).<BR>-ásya 1〉 〰 cid vṛdhás {81,2}.<BR>-ā́s 2〉 {321,5}.<BR>-ā́ṇi 2〉 {126,7}.<BR>-ébhis 2〉 {31,6}; {328,3}; {598,6}; {864,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0576" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

