दस्म|दस्मः
dasmá, a., wunderkräftig, wunderbar [von daṃs].<BR>-a indra {538,8}; {4,6}; {62,5}. _{62,11}. _{62,12}; {385,7}; {459,5}; {701,18}; {869,2}; {973,5}; pūṣan {138,4}; agne {200,5}; {297,3}; {442,1}; {833,1}; {519,4}; viśpate (agne) {360,5}; {712,7}; atithe (agne) {683,7}.<BR>-ás índras {534,11}; {129,3}; {925,10}; agnís {237,2}; {148,4}; {192,4}. — sómas {794,1}.<BR>-ám pūṣáṇam {42,10}; agním {837,4}; {77,3}; {857,3}(?); índram {697,1}; {388,1}; {547,9}.<BR>-ā́t (índrāt) {665,35}.<BR>-ásya (índrasya) {62,6}; (agnés) {235,7}; {371,4}.<BR>-é [L.] (agnaú ?) {289,15}.<BR>-ā́ [du.] índrāváruṇā {337,6}.<BR>-ās (marutas) {395,13}.<BR>-ā́s (devā́s) {351,2}; {403,3}; harítas (agnés) {302,9}.<BR>-átamas índras {211,6} (zu sprech. -átāmas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0584" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

