दुछुना|दुच्छुना
duchúnā, f. [wol aus dus und śuná, BR.], 1〉 Unheil, unheilbringende That; 2〉 persönlich: unheilbringendes Wesen, Unholdin.<BR>-ā 1〉 hárasvatī {214,6}. — 2〉 {640,4}; {684,13}.<BR>-ām 1〉 {778,19}; {1001,2} (parallel durmatím).<BR>-āyai 2〉 {189,5}.<BR>-ās [A.] 2〉 {116,21}; {399,5}; {453,6}; {488,30}.<BR>-ābhias [D.] 2〉 {223,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0612" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

