duróka-śocis, a., ungewöhnlich leuchtend.<BR>-is (agnís) {66,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0614" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरोण
duroṇá, n. [von dura = dúr, Thür, wie duryoṇá von dúrya], 1〉 Haus, Wohnung; 2〉 Wohnsitz, Heimat; 3〉 duroṇé, zu Hause, in der Heimat, mit dem Gegensatze ádhvan oder durgé. — Adj. mádhya, svá; Gen. dāśúṣas, sukṛ́tas, stotúr, mánuṣas, pitúr.<BR>-ám 1〉 {117,2}; {183,1}; {309,1}; {430,4}.<BR>-é {69,4}. _{69,5}; {108,7}; {117,7}; {248,3}; {252,5}; {259,4}; {292,9}; {298,7}; {300,7}; {320,8}; {358,5}; {453,1}; {528,1}; {532,8}; {558,4}; {586,2}; {608,3}; {639,27}; {696,2}; {866,13}; {930,4}; {936,1}; {946,7}. — 2〉 viśā́m {70,4}; {523,4}; mártiānām {235,18}; apā́m {259,5}; ṛtásya {576,5}. — 3〉 {863,10}; {324,3} (durgé).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0614" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरोणयु
duroṇayú, a., das Haus [duroṇá] liebend.<BR>-ús (agnís) {669,19}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0614" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरोणसद्
