dúr-dhita, a., ungeordnet [dhita Part. II. von 1. dhā], Gegensatz súdhita.<BR>-āt {140,11}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0615" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

