देव|देवं|देवः
(2. deva,) m., Spieler [von div. 3], enthalten in ánṛtadeva, antidevá.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0632" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवक|देवकः
dévaka, m., Gott, Deminutiv von devá.<BR>-am {534,20} 〰 cid mānyamānám jaghantha, áva tmánā bṛhatás śámbaram bhed, selbst ihn, der sich einen Gott dünkte.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0632" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

