देवकाम
devá-kāma, a., götterliebend.<BR>-as vīrás {194,9}; {238,9}; náryas {321,1}; yás {868,9}; {986,3}.<BR>-ā [f.] {911,44}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0632" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवकिल्बिष
