drapsá, m., der Tropfen [für *dravsá von dru Ku. Zeitschr. 〔2,138〕; 〔7,63〕], im sing. auch die tropfende Flüssigkeit; namentlich 2〉 vom Soma; 3〉 vom Regen; 4〉 bildlich vom männlichen Samen {549,11} (vgl. V. _{549,13}); 5〉 die Funken als Tropfen des Feuers; 6〉 der Mond oder die Sonne ({309,2}) als der lichte Tropfen am Himmel. — Adj. aruṇá, udaprút, kṛṣṇá, govindú, camūṣád, nī́lavat, mádhu, mádhumat, mayobhū́, yavasā́d (Bed. 5), vi cakṣaṇá, vibhū́, śyenájūta, śvetá (Bed. 6), skanná, svā́diṣṭha.<BR>-ás 2〉 {482,3}; {637,14} (bhettā́ purā́m); {639,31}; {705,13}. _{705,15}; {781,2}; {801,2}; {808,19}; {843,11}—_{843,13}. — 3〉 {924,3}. — 6〉 {603,6}; {949,8}.<BR>-ám 2〉 {705,14}; {790,4}; {797,10}; {843,11}. — 4〉 {549,11}. — 5〉 {837,4} (agním). — 6〉 {309,2}.<BR>-ásya 2〉 srákve {785,1} (dhámatas).<BR>-ā́sas 2〉 {718,4}.<BR>-ā́s 1〉 {627,16}. — 2〉 {14,4}; {818,8}. — 3〉 {417,4}; {924,4}. — 5〉 {94,11}.<BR>-ā́n 1〉 {809,56} 〰 īráyan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0644" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रप्सिन्
drapsín, a., Tropfen gebend, regnend [von drapsá].<BR>-ínas [N. p.] (marútas) {64,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0644" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव|द्रवः
dravá, a., laufend [von dru].<BR>-ás dadhikrā́vā {336,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0644" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

