द्रविण|द्रविणं
dráviṇa, n., bewegliches Gut (im Gegensatze zu Haus und Acker), Habe, Reichthum [von dru]; 2〉 auch mit Gen. — Dazu die Adj. citrá, máhi, vāmá, viśvávāra, śréṣṭha.<BR>-am {94,14}; {214,15}; {235,22}; {236,6}; {295,6}; {301,11}. _{301,12}; {307,3}; {316,9}; {337,9}; {347,7}; {350,1}; {382,2}; {408,15}; {510,1}. _{510,6}; {511,5}; {525,1}; {526,3}; {655,10}—_{655,12}; {808,12}; {809,51}; {857,2}; 861,13^1}; {862,13}; {863,10}; {871,11}; {887,12}; {893,7}; {896,7}; {906,4}. _{906,7}; {907,1}; {908,4}; {951,2}; {954,3}. — 2〉 náras, gós {121,2}; yuvós {292,6}; asya (índrasya) {319,4}.<BR>-āya 1〉 {244,6} mahé vā́jāya 〰.<BR>-āni {212,5}. _{212,6}; {329,10}; {354,10}; {358,7}; {446,1}; {790,5}; {821,9}.<BR>-ā {242,1}.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Mārcis Gasūns, Jim Funderburk on 20200109. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/GRA/issues/5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0645" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

