dráviṇas, n. (bewegliches) Gut, Habe [siehe dráviṇa]; 2〉 konkret Spender des Guts.<BR>-as [V.] 2〉 agne {241,10}.<BR>-as [A.] {510,3}.<BR>-asas [G.] draviṇodā́s {15,7}; {96,8}; draviṇasyús {890,16}.<BR>-asas [Ab.] {330,5} ā́ … yāta ‥ mahás 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0645" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

