draviṇo-dá, a., m., Gut [dráviṇas] gebend, Reichthumgeber.<BR>-éṣu {53,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0645" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

