द्विपद्
dvi-pád, a., stark dvi-pā́d, zwei Füsse [pád] habend, zweifüssig; 2〉 zwei Versglieder [pád = pāda] enthaltend; 3〉 n. das zweifüssige Geschlecht. — Ueberall mit dem Gegensatze cátuṣpad.<BR>-ā́d [N. s. m.] {943,8}.<BR>-ā́d [n.] 2〉 yád (uktám) {853,10}. — 3〉 {347,5}.<BR>-ád [n.] yád {94,5}. — 3〉 {49,3}; {124,1}; {923,20}.<BR>-ádā 2〉 vākéna {164,24}.<BR>-áde jánmane {863,11}. — 3〉 {114,1}; {157,3}; {296,14}; {435,2}; {515,1}; {570,1}; {781,7}; {911,43}. _{911,44}; {991,1}.<BR>-ā́de [D., metrisch für -áde] 3〉 {121,3}.<BR>-ádas [Ab.] {943,8}.<BR>-ádas [G.] 3〉 yás ī́śe asyá 〰 {947,3}; víśvasya 〰 … nivéśane {512,2}.<BR>-ā́das [N. p.] {647,12}.<BR>-ádām 〰 abhiṣvaré {943,8}.<BR>-ádī gaurī́s {164,41}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0652" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

