धर्तृ|धर्त्तृ
dhartṛ́, m., Träger, Stützer, Bewahrer [von dhṛ]; 2〉 n., -ári Stütze.<BR>-ar dhánānām {102,5}.<BR>-ā́ {887,9}; divás {283,4}; {349,2}; {788,1}; {821,6}; {891,13}; {975,4}; víśvasya kármaṇas {11,4}; kṛṣṭīnā́m {355,6}; bhúvanānaam {661,5}; nas {551,3}; rāyás {369,1}; {747,2}.<BR>-ā́ram divás {738,2}; oṇíos {777,11}; mā́nuṣīṇaam viśā́m {363,3}.<BR>-ári 2〉 ṛtásya {214,17}; daíviam {798,42}.<BR>-ā́ra [du.] carṣaṇīnáam {17,2}; {421,2}; rájasas {423,4}.<BR>-ā́ras divás {836,2}; {892,10}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0659" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

