धुनि|धुनिः
dhúni, a., m. [von dhvan], 1〉 a., rauschend, brausend, schnaubend, tosend; 2〉 m., Eigenname eines mit cúmuri zusammengenannten von Indra bekämpften Dämons.<BR>-is 1〉 (índras) {174,9}; {388,5}. _{388,8}; {461,12}; sómas {915,5}; áhis vā́tas iva {79,1}; múnis {572,8}.<BR>-im 1〉 mahī́m {206,5}; antárikṣam ácvam iva {975,1}. — 2〉 {206,9}; {459,8}; {535,4}; {939,9}.<BR>-ī [du.] 1〉 áśvā vā́tasya {848,4}.<BR>-ayas [m.] 1〉 {921,3}; marútas {507,10}; {64,5}; {87,3}; {414,7}; vā́tāsas {904,3}.<BR>-ayas [f.] (ā́pas) {221,2}; gíras {521,5}.<BR>-īnaam (marútām) {640,14}; {441,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0687" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

