nabho-víd, a., des Gewölks oder Wassers [nábhas] kundig [víd von 2. vid].<BR>-íd (agnís) {872,1} (sīdat apā́m upásthe).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0709" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

