नमस्य्
√namasy, verehren, anbeten [von námas] einen Gott [A.], oder 2〉 die Eigenschaft [A.] eines Gottes, oder 3〉 ohne Objekt.<BR>Stamm namasyá:<BR>-ā́mas agním {251,4}.<BR>-ánti (agním) {36,19}; savitā́ram {296,12}.<BR>-an namasíam (agním) {72,5}.<BR>-á (-ā́): daíviam jánam {44,6}; mā́rutam gaṇám {406,13}; váruṇam {662,2}; kalmalīkínam (rudrám) {224,8}.<BR>-a sómam {826,2}.<BR>-áta havyádātim (agním) {236,8}.<BR>-ata (-atā) bṛ́haspátim {296,5}. — 2〉 (índrasya) sáhas {84,5}.<BR>Impf. ánamasya (betont {874,6}):<BR>-an (agním) {450,7}.<BR>-us 3〉 namasvínas {874,6}.<BR>Part. namasyát:<BR>-án índram {33,2}.<BR>-ántas 3〉 {127,7}; {115,3}; {302,11}.<BR>-ántīs 3〉 {291,3}; {807,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0712" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्य|नमस्यः
