नित्य|नित्यं|नित्यः
nítya, a. [von ní], ursprünglich „innerlich, heimisch“, daher 1〉 eigen, angehörig, Gegensatz áraṇa ({287,24}; {439,7}; {520,7}); 2〉 stetig, beständig, fortwährend.<BR>-as 1〉 sūnús {66,1}; āpís {604,6}; krátus {66,5}. — 2〉 von Agni: {140,7}; {141,2}; {259,5}; {517,2}; {838,2}; {857,4}.<BR>-am [m.] 1〉 pátim {71,1}; sūnúm {166,2}; {185,2}; {865,14}; tánayam {249,2}; áśvam {287,24}; veśám {439,7}. — 2〉 yajñám {517,12}; von Agni: {73,4} (iddhám); {355,7}.<BR>-am [n.] 1〉 sádas {804,3}. — 2〉 rékṇas {624,18}.<BR>-ena 2〉 havíṣā {300,7}.<BR>-āt 1〉 rāyás {1025,2}.<BR>-asya 1〉 〰 rāyás pátayas siāma {337,10}; {520,7}.<BR>-e 1〉 toké {193,11}; tánaye {517,21}; sádane {148,3}.<BR>-ās 2〉 puṣṭáyas {218,12}.<BR>-āsas 1〉 pretā́ras {148,5}. — 2〉 vājínas {360,1}.<BR>-ā 2〉 āhávanāni {517,17}.<BR>-ayā 2〉 āśírā {651,5}; vācā́ {684,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0729" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

