नित्यहोतृ
nítya-hotṛ, a., stets opfernd.<BR>-ā (agnís) {833,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0729" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

