निद्
níd, f., 1〉 Spott, Schmähung, Schmach, Verachtung, insbesondere 2〉 nidé mit radh oder kṛ dem Spotte, der Schmach oder Verachtung preisgeben; 3〉 nidé mit dhā verachten; 4〉 concret: Spötter, Schmäher, Verächter.<BR>-ídam-nidam 4〉 {791,5}.<BR>-idé 1〉 {225,10}(?). — 2〉 {250,5}; {275,6}; {547,5}; {591,8}; {610,3}; {628,13}. — 3〉 {214,14}.<BR>-idás [Ab.] 1〉 {24,4}; {225,15}; {441,6}; {455,5}; {502,11}; {687,6}; {741,5}; {773,30}; {782,10}. — 4〉 neben druhás {300,15}; {532,8}.<BR>-ídas [N. pl.] 4〉 {4,5}.<BR>-idás [A. pl.] 4〉 {129,6}; {407,14}; {441,9}; {513,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0730" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदा
