(níndya), níndia, a., verächtlich, verachtungswerth [von nind].<BR>-āsas ninditā́ras {356,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0731" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

