निरामिन्
nirāmín, a., verweilend bei (L.) [von ram mit ní].<BR>-íṇas [N. pl.] {214,16} abhí druhás padé 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरृति|निरृतिः
nírṛti, f. [von ar mit nís], 1〉 Auflösung, Verwesung, Verderben; 2〉 personificirt als Todesgenie; 3〉 Abgrund, Tiefe als Sitz der Verwesung (BR.).<BR>-is 1〉 {38,6} neben durháṇā; {836,11}. — 2〉 {395,17}; {553,7} (devī́); {862,2}; {885,1}—_{885,4}.<BR>-im 1〉 {24,9}; {515,2}; {164,32}. — 2〉 {862,4}; {902,4}.<BR>-yai 2〉 {990,1}.<BR>-yās [G.] 2〉 {991,1} dūtás.<BR>-es [G.] 1〉 upásthe {117,5}; {620,9}; {921,14}; upásthāt {844,10}; {987,2}. — 3〉 {574,1} avaṃśā́t.<BR>-īs [N. pl.] 2〉 tisrás {940,2}.<BR>-īnaam 1〉 {644,24} parivṛ́jam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरृथ|निरृथः
