nṛ́tama, a., männlichst, kräftigst [Superlativ von nṛ́].<BR>-a agne {358,6}; indra {644,10}.<BR>-a mit verlängerter Penultima: indra {535,10}; {474,3}.<BR>-as agnís {77,4}; {235,12}; {301,2}; {522,4}; índras {312,4}; {313,11}; {318,2}; {459,7}; {855,1}; {925,7}.<BR>-am índram {264,22}; {283,2}; {285,4}; {915,1}.<BR>-āya (agnáye) {59,4}; índrāya {321,4}; {644,1}.<BR>-asya (agnés) {253,3}; ṛnaṃcayásya {384,12}; índrasya {855,2}.<BR>-āsas marútas {87,1}; sūráyas {466,7}.<BR>-ās (nṛ́tāmās zu sprechen) {445,7} (Opferer).<BR>-ābhis ūtī́ {460,10}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0751" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

