पक्ति|पक्तिः
paktí, f., gekochtes Gericht [von pac].<BR>-ís {320,5}; {470,4} (pacyáte).<BR>-ím {321,6} (kṛṇute).<BR>-áye {321,7}.<BR>-ī́s [A.] Object zu pac {320,7}; {383,11}; {548,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0757a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्थ
