पाप|पापं|पापः
pāpá, a., schlecht, böse; insbesondere 2〉 -áyā [I. f.] auf üble Weise, schlecht; 3〉 -áyā‿amuyā́ so übel, so schlecht.<BR>-ás saṃkalpás {990,5}.<BR>-ám {836,12} (〰 āhus yás svásāram nigáchāt).<BR>-ásya rakṣásas {129,11}.<BR>-ā́sas {670,11} (ná 〰 manāmahe); {301,5} (neben ánṛtās, asatyā́s).<BR>-ā́s yé {190,5}.<BR>-ī́s [N. pl. f.] tanúas {934,6}.<BR>-áyā [I. s. f.] 2〉 {639,26} (siāt); {897,9}. — 3〉 {29,5} (nuvántam); {911,30}; {961,2} (cárantam).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0806" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

