पितुमत्|पितुमन्त्
pitumát, a. [von pitú], 1〉 von Opferspeise begleitet; 2〉 mit Nahrung versehen; 3〉 nah rungsreich, nährend.<BR>-át 1〉 vácas {101,1}.<BR>-ā́n 2〉 pṛkṣás {141,2}; kṣáyas {144,7}; {890,11}; pánthās {288,21}.<BR>-ántam 2〉 kṣáyam _{402,1}.<BR>-átī 2〉 saṃsád {297,8}.<BR>-átīm 3〉 ū́rjam {116,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0812" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

