पुष्टि|पुष्टिः
puṣṭí, f., 1〉 Gedeihen, Wachsthum, Mehrung, auch im plur. 2〉 Nahrung.<BR>-ís 2〉 raṇvā́ {65,5}; {195,4}; sudṛ́śī {312,15}.<BR>-ím 2〉 {77,5}; {122,7}; {204,4}; {329,2}; {364,3} (neben gáyam); {443,1}; {504,6} (sūriā́yās); {668,6}; {1028,7}.<BR>-yaí 2〉 {931,5}; {932,4}.<BR>-és 2〉 {337,10} (neben áśvyasya u. s. w.); {395,20}.<BR>-aú 1〉 ráthiasya {395,3}; jéniasya {887,24}.<BR>-áyas 2〉 {218,12} (yám vardháyanti 〰).<BR>-ī́s 2〉 {203,5} (mināti).<BR>-īnáam 2〉 sákhā {852,7} (neben vā́jānaam pátis).<BR>-íṣu 1〉 tánayasya {166,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0838" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

