पेदु
pedú, m., Eigenname eines Mannes, dem die Aśvinen das weisse (śvetám {118,9}; {119,10}), schlangentödtende (ahihánam {117,9}; {118,9}) Ross schenken.<BR>-áve {117,9}; {118,9}; {119,10}; {587,5}; {865,10}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0861" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

