पेरु|पेरुः
perú, a. [von par], 1〉 durchdringend, durchfahrend vom Regen ({438,2}) und dem Fahrzeuge was den Bhudschyu durchs Meer fährt ({158,3}); 2〉 rettend.<BR>-ús 1〉 {158,3}. — 2〉 apā́m nápāt {551,13}.<BR>-úm 1〉 {438,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0861" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेरु|पेरुः
