paúṃsya, paúṃsia, n., a. [von puṃs], 1〉 n., Manneskraft, Heldenkraft; 2〉 n., Mannesthat, Heldenthat; 3〉 Heldenschaar; 4〉 a., zu Männern oder Helden gehörig (durch den Gen. pl. wiederzugeben).<BR>-iam 1〉 {80,10}; {101,3}; {155,3}. _{155,4}; {204,10}; {389,4}; {626,31}; {635,8}; {665,26}; {702,15}; {849,5}; {902,2}; {1020,4}. — 2〉 {326,8}. _{326,23}; {623,20}; {627,23}; {652,3}; {672,3}; {675,9}. — 4〉 dhánus {811,1}; ráṇam {939,4}.<BR>-iāya 1〉 {546,1} oder 4〉 (kṣatrā́ya).<BR>-ye 1〉 {337,6}.<BR>-ie 1〉 {56,3}; {876,3}; {918,7}.<BR>-iāni 1〉 {477,3}; {881,7} — 3〉 {169,6} (tasthús).<BR>-iā 1〉 {5,9}; {139,8}; {413,4}; {487,7}; {823,3}; {919,13}. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=863" target="_blank">Page863</a>] — 2〉 {166,7} (prathamā́ni); {328,11}; {672,8}; {704,6}.<BR>-iebhis 1〉 {100,3}. _{100,10}; {165,7}; {507,2}.<BR>-iais 1〉 {855,7}; {885,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0862" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

