pragardhín, a., begehrlich vordringend [von gṛdh mit prá].<BR>-ínas [G.] vés {336,3}.<BR>-ínī [N. s. f.] sénā {968,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0864" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

