prátijanya, a., gegnerisch [von pratijaná], Gegensatz sájanya ({346,9}).<BR>-āni dhánāni {346,9}; víśvā {346,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजूतिवर्पस्
pratijūti-varpas, a., jedem Antriebe (pratijūti) entsprechende Kunstgriffe anwendend.<BR>-asas {294,1} yā́bhis māyā́bhis 〰 saúdhanvanās yajñíyam bhāgám ānaśá.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0869" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदीवन्
pratidī́van, m., Gegenspieler, Gegner im Würfelspiele [von div mit práti].<BR>-ne {860,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0869" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

