prati-doṣám, gegen Abend [aus práti und doṣā́] {35,10}; {512,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0869" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

