pratidhā́, f., Zug, Schluck (beim Trinken), [von 2. dhā mit prati].<BR>-ā́ [I.] ékayā 〰 ‿apibat sākám sárāṃsi triṃśátam {686,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0869" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधि|प्रतिधिः
pratidhí, m., Querhölzer an der Wagendeichsel [von 1. dhā mit práti].<BR>-áyas {911,8} stómās āsan 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0869" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमा
pratimā́, f., Abbild [von 1. mā mit práti], Gegensatz pramā́.<BR>-ā́ [N.] {956,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0869" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमान|प्रतिमानं
pratimā́na, n. [von 1. mā mit práti], 1〉 was gleiches Maass d. h. gleiche Grösse oder Kraft mit einem andern [G.] hat; insbesondere 2〉 gleich starker, ebenbürtiger Gegner; 3〉 Vergleichung. — Vgl. a-pratimāná.<BR>-am 1〉 ójasas {52,12}; {102,8}; pṛthivyā́s {52,13}; víśvasya {203,9}; divás pṛthivyā́s {937,5}; satás-satas {265,8}. — 2〉 {459,12} (neben śátrus); {314,4}; {964,3} (vidát dāsā́ya 〰 ā́rias); vṛ́ṣnas {32,7} (búbhūṣan). — 3〉 akalpás índras 〰 ójasā {102,6}.<BR>-āni {915,5}; {946,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0869" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरूप|प्रतिरूपं
práti-rūpa, a., gleiche Gestalt [rūpá] habend, ähnlich.<BR>-as rūpám-rūpam 〰 babhūva (índras) {488,18}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0869" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेश|प्रतिवेशः
