बलिहृत्
bali-hṛ́t, a., Abgabe [balí] leistend [hṛ́t von hṛ], steuerpflichtig.<BR>-ṛ́tas [A. pl. f.] {522,5} víśas cakre 〰; {999,6} te ‥ víśas 〰 karat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0902" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

