बहुल|बहुलं|बहुलः
bahulá, a. [von baṃh], 1〉 dick von Gliedern des Leibes; 2〉 ausgedehnt, gross, weit neben pṛthú ({185,7}; {189,2}; {192,12}; {319,10}; {927,8}; {1004,2}); zu dem auch bisweilen urú ({185,7}; {189,2}; {1004,2}); gabhīrá ({319,10}; {1004,2}) hinzutritt; 3〉 reichlich, viel; 4〉 n., dichte Finsterniss (?); vgl. bahulám támas Ait. Br. 〔7,13〕 und m. dunkle (dicke, trübe) Hälfte eines Monats bei BR.<BR>-ás 2〉 rayís {192,12}.<BR>-ám [m.] 2〉 rayím {235,19}; {784,8}; {819,21}.<BR>-ám [n.] 2〉 śárma {409,9}; {492,5}; dhánam {868,5}.<BR>-é [L.] 4〉 {874,10} druhás tasthau 〰 baddhás antár.<BR>-ā́ [du.] 1〉 gábhastī {460,3}.<BR>-ā́s [m.] 2〉 camasā́s {54,9}.<BR>-ā́ [n.] 2〉 várma {927,8}.<BR>-ā́ni 3〉 áhāni {592,3}.<BR>-ā́ [f.] 2〉 pū́r {189,2}.<BR>-é [d. f.] 2〉 dyā́vāpṛthivī́ {185,7}; {319,10}; {1004,2}.<BR>-ā́s [A. pl. f.] 3〉 drúhas ádevīs {265,19} (oder dick, plump).<BR>-ābhis 3〉 ūtíbhis {287,21}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0903" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

