bāhú, m., Arm, besonders der Unterarm als der starke, compacte, von bāh (siehe baṃh), gr. πῆχυ-ς, altn. bog-r, ahd. buoc [Cu. 〔176〕]; 2〉 beim vierfüssigen Thiere die beiden Vorderfüsse. — Vgl. ugrá-bāhu u. s. w.<BR>-úm {516,14}; {836,10}.<BR>-ū́ [du.] {95,7}; {102,6}; {190,3}; {285,12}; {349,3}. _{349,4}; {397,4}; {488,8}; {512,1}. _{512,5}; {561,2}; {595,2}; {670,18}; {686,11}; {916,11}. _{916,12}; {928,4}; {947,4}; {968,5}. — 2〉 {163,1} hariṇásya.<BR>-úbhyām [D.] {208,6}.<BR>-úbhyām [I.] {215,7}; {318,2}; {538,1}; {710,4}; {833,5}; {907,3}.<BR>-úbhyām [Ab.] {989,2}.<BR>-uós [G.] dákṣasya {370,2}.<BR>-uós [L.] {51,7}; {52,8}; {63,2}; {80,8}; {202,4}. _{202,6}; {211,8}; {227,5}; {278,4}; {318,3}; {411,6}; {418,1}; {464,1}; {487,14}; {500,7}; {541,1}; {600,1}; {705,3}. _{705,5}; {878,5}; {979,4}.<BR>-ávas {929,13}.<BR>-ū́n {205,4}; {913,4}.<BR>-úbhis {85,6} (prá jigāta); {263,6}; {508,1}; {614,4}.<BR>-úṣu {166,10}; {640,11}; {710,13} (daśásu).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0906" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

