bráhma-kṛti, f., Gebetverrichtung, Andacht.<BR>-im {544,5}; {545,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0915" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

