भरि
(bhári), a., bringend [von bhṛ], in saho-bhári.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0929" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भरित्र|भरित्रं
bharítra, n., Arm, als der tragende [bhṛ].<BR>-ais {270,7} aṃśúm duhanti hastínas 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0929" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भरिष
bhar-iṣá, a., nach Beute [bhar = bhára 2] begierig [iṣá], neben gav-iṣá.<BR>-ás {336,2} sátvā 〰 gaviṣás.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0929" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भरीमन्
bhárīman, m., Erhaltung, Ernährung, Nahrung [bhṛ].<BR>-abhis pipṛtā́m nas 〰 {22,13}; {890,14} ubhé (dyā́vāpṛthivī́) bibhṛtas ubháyam (jánma) 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0929" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भरेषुजा
bhareṣu-jā́, a., in Schlachten [bhára 3] geboren [jā́ von jan], d. h. dessen Element von Geburt an die Schlachten sind.<BR>-ā́m (sómam) {91,21}, neben áṣāḍham yutsú, pṛ́tanāsu páprim, suarṣā́m, apsā́m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0929" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भर्गस्
bhárgas, n., Glanz [von bharj oder bhṛj = bhrāj; vgl. Cu. 〔161〕, sowie auch bhṛjj].<BR>-as devásya (agnés) {141,1}; devásya savitúr {296,10}; bhárgas ha nā́ma {887,14}, neben agnís ha nā́ma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0929" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

