bhartṛ́, m., Träger [von bhṛ].<BR>-ā́ vájrasya {848,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0929" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

