भर्व्
√bharv, kauen, verzehren [vgl. Fi. 〔136〕].<BR>Stamm bhárva:<BR>-ati {143,5} agnís jámbhais tigitaís atti 〰, yodhás ná śátrūn.<BR>Part. bhárvat:<BR>-an agnís {447,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0929" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

