भानु|भानुः
bhānú, m., Licht, Strahl [von bhā]; vgl. citrábhānu u. s. w., Adj. arṇavá, citrá, tveṣá.<BR>-ús {256,2}; {297,17}; {341,1}; {406,6}; {550,7}; {797,12}; {926,12}; {949,8}.<BR>-úm {92,1}. _{92,2}. _{92,5}; {295,7}; {302,2}; {309,2}; {413,1}; {503,2}; {519,6}; {522,2}; {588,4}; {595,1}; {625,1}; {829,2}; {879,6}.<BR>-únā {48,9}. _{48,15}; {193,8}; {199,4}; {207,4}; {236,3}; {255,4}; {391,1} (sū́riasya); {447,6}; {456,5}; {457,21}; {489,6}; {506,1}; {525,4}; {629,18}; {777,4}; {827,1}; {863,4}. _{863,10}; {869,9}; {871,4}; {901,3}; {914,3}; {966,2}.<BR>-áve {370,1}; {520,1}; neben agnáye.<BR>-ávas {36,3}; {92,2}; {97,5}; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=933" target="_blank">Page933</a>] {143,3} {235,14}; {355,1}; {505,2}; {591,3}.<BR>-úbhis {87,6}; {593,5}; {627,8}. _{627,36}; {829,5}; {832,1}. _{832,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0932" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भानुमत्|भानुमन्त्
