भासाकेतु
bhāsā́-ketu, a., durch Licht [bhāsā́ I. von bhā́s] sichtbar [ketú], im Lichte erscheinend.<BR>-um agním {846,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0934" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भास्वत्|भास्वन्त्
(bhā́svat), bháasvat, a., leuchtend, strahlend [von bhā́s, bháas].<BR>-antam (sū́riam) {863,8}.<BR>-atī [N. s. f.] nayitrī́ sūnṛ́tānām (uṣā́s) {92,7}; {113,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0934" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

