भोज|भोजः
bhojá, a., freigiebig [von 2. bhuj, in caus. Sinne: Genuss gewähren].<BR>-ás {933,11}; sūrís {679,13}; sá {943,3}.<BR>-ám {933,11}; índram {205,10}; {464,9}; {208,8}; {868,3}; dātā́ram {623,24}; havíṣmantam {341,7}.<BR>-ā́ya {933,10}.<BR>-ásya {933,10}; te (índrasya) {534,21}.<BR>-ā́s [m.] {933,8}. _{933,9}; áṅgirasas {287,7}.<BR>-ā́n {347,3}; (marútas) {407,16}.<BR>-éṣu {645,21}; yájvasu {977,2}. _{977,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0965" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भोजन|भोजनं|भोजनः
bhójana, n. [von 2. bhuj], 1〉 Erquickung, Ernährung; 2〉 persönlich gefasst: Erquicker, Ernährer; 3〉 was jemand [G.] erfreut, erquickt, woran er Genuss findet; 4〉 Labungsmittel, Erquickungsmittel (was jemand [G.] darreicht oder besitzt); 5〉 Nahrungsmittel, Vorrath; 6〉 Vorrath, Habe mit dem Gen. des Besitzers.<BR>-a [V.] 2〉 víśvasya‿ amṛta 〰 {44,5} (oder amṛtabhojana zu verbinden BR.).<BR>-am 3〉 asya (índrasya) {849,6}. — 4〉 savitúr {436,1}; citrám {584,5}; {590,2}; súbhadram {621,34}. — 5〉 {204,2}. _{204,4}. _{204,6}; {278,3}; {874,1}. — 6〉 paṇés {83,4}; {388,7}; áyajyos {217,1}.<BR>-āya 1〉 {264,14}; {437,10}.<BR>-ā 5〉 {332,8} (náriāṇi); {534,15}. _{534,17}; {870,7} (vayúnāni). — 6〉 jánānām {799,6}.<BR>-āni 4〉 {104,8} (priyā́); te (índrasya) {535,6}. — 5〉 {521,3}. — 6〉 śatrūyatā́m {358,5}; eṣām {957,2}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0965" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

