bhrā́j, f., Glanz.<BR>-ājā́ {810,3} 〰 ná éti gavyayús.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0966" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्राज|भ्राजः
