मधुवृध्
madhu-vṛ́dh, a., an Süssigkeit [madhu 4] reich, wie es scheint von der regenreichen Wolke (vgl. BR.).<BR>-ṛ́dham {901,8} ádhi vaste subhágā 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0988" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मधुव्रत|मधुव्रतः
mádhu-vrata, a., Süssigkeit, Segen [madhu 4] wirkend.<BR>-e [d. f.] dyā́vāpṛthivī́ {511,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0988" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मधुश्चुत्
madhu-ścút, a., 1〉 von Süssigkeit triefend [ścút von ścut]; auch 2〉 bildlich von Segen [mádhu 4] triefend.<BR>-útam 1〉 kóśam {724,6}; {735,4}; {748,2}; {778,11}; {815,3}; {819,12}; hárim (sómam) {762,3}; várṇam (sómasya) {777,8}; sū́ram (sómam) {779,9}. — 2〉 ūrmím {353,2}.<BR>-útā [d. f.] 2〉 dyā́vāpṛthivī́ {511,5}.<BR>-útas [N. p. f.] 1〉 dhā́rās {774,7}.<BR>-útas [A.] 2〉 (apás) {565,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0988" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मधुषुत्
madhu-ṣút, a., Süssigkeit [mádhu] erzeugend [sút von su], und zwar 1〉 Somasüss auspressend; 2〉 süssen Geschmack hervorrufend.<BR>-út 1〉 grā́vā {299,3}; {926,8}.<BR>-úttamas 1〉 grā́vā {890,15}. — 2〉 sómas {292,9}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0988" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

