मनस्मय
manasmáya, a., durch Gedanken erzeugt, geistig.<BR>-am ánas (sūriā́yās) {911,12}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=0995" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मनस्य्
