mandána, a., erfreuend [von mand].<BR>-ās [A. p. f.] (gā́s) {819,26}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1002" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

