मन्युमी
manyu-mī́, a., 1〉 den Zorn (des Feindes) hemmend [mī́ von mī]; 2〉 im Zorne vernichtend.<BR>-ī́s [N. s. m.] 1〉 von Indra {100,6}; {214,4} (brahmadvíṣas).<BR>-ías [G.] 2〉 índras manyúm 〰 mimāya {534,16}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1005" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

