mahitvá, n. [von máhi], 1〉 Grösse, weite Ausdehnung; 2〉 Grösse, Herrlichkeit, Macht der Götter; 3〉 Geistesgrösse, Begeisterung von Sängern und Opferern.<BR>-ám 2〉 {8,5}; {59,5}. _{59,6}; {61,9}; {87,3}; {115,4} (sū́riasya); {138,1}; {166,1}; {218,8}; {266,9}. _{266,11}; {416,2}; {462,2}; {508,8}; {513,1}; {615,1}; {830,4}; {852,2}; {905,1}; indriyám {760,5}; rudríyam {556,5}.<BR>-ā́ [I.] 1〉 {338,2} (〰 urvī́ gabhīré rájasī); mit prá ric {109,6}; {164,25}; {915,1}. — 2〉 {52,13}; {67,9}; {68,2}; {91,2}; {206,6}; {235,4}; {288,15}; {312,5}; {356,9}; {412,2} (ámitās); {470,5}; {508,3}. _{508,10}; {509,4}; {529,2}; {536,4}; {539,3}; {574,1}; {577,4}; {613,8} (vāvṛdhatus); {616,3}; {901,7}; {914,9}; {922,11}; {947,3}. _{947,4}. — 3〉 {880,1}; {881,5}; {882,7}.<BR>-ā́ [I. viersilbig], besser mahitvanā́ zu lesen. — 2〉 {645,18}.<BR>-ébhis 2〉 {939,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

