mahitvaná, n., dass.<BR>-ám 2〉 (marútām) {166,12}; {408,5}; {409,4}; (bṛ́haspátes) {214,4}; (ṛbhūṇā́m) {332,3}.<BR>-ā́ [I.] 2〉 mit Macht oder Herrlichkeit {85,7}; {86,9}; {349,5}; {435,3}; {457,20}; {644,13}; {677,2}; {812,9}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महिन्
