मान्य|मान्यः
(mānyá), māniá [von 1. mā́na], sinnig, dichterisch (so wol richtiger als aus 1. mā́na 2), Beiwort zu kārú.<BR>-ásya kārós {165,15}; {177,5}; {184,4}; ā́ yád duvasyā́t duváse ná kārús asmā́n cak(a)re 〰 medhā́ {165,14}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1034" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मानिअ
