मास्
1. mā́s, m. [Cu. 〔471〕; vgl. auch māṃś-catú], der Mond, als der Zeitmessende [1. mā], daher 2〉 der Monat. — Vgl. sū́riā-mā́s.<BR>-ā́sam 2〉 neben śarádam, áhar {582,11} (kann auch zu mā́sa gehören).<BR>-āsā́ {475,4} (arcā́); {964,4} (〰 ‿iva sū́rias).<BR>-āsí {838,7} sū́rye jyótis adadhus 〰 aktū́n. — 2〉 daśamé {1010,3}.<BR>-āsí-māsi 2〉 neben áharahar {878,3}.<BR>-ā́sas [G.] 2〉 {911,5} sámānām 〰 ā́kṛtis.<BR>-āsás [A. p.] 2〉 duā́daśa {25,8}; dáśa {399,7}. _{399,11}; neben śarádas {314,4}; {607,2}. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1037" target="_blank">Page1037</a>]<BR>-adbhís 2〉 neben śarádbhis {215,5}.<BR>-āsā́m 2〉 {964,6} 〰 vidhā́nam adadhās ádhi dyávi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1036" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मास्
2. mā́s, n., Fleisch [siehe māṃsá und māṃspacana].<BR>-ā́s {329,4} yád saṃvátsam ṛbhávas 〰 ápiṃśan; {383,8} trī́ yád śatā́ mahiṣā́ṇām ághas 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1037" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

