मेहना
mehánā, f., reichliche Strömung, Fülle [von mih]; 2〉 Instr. in reichlicher Menge.<BR>-ā [I.] 2〉 {392,3} (śúṣmāsas); {393,1} (rā́dhas); {624,21} (gā́m, áśvam bhajanta); {672,12} (párvatāsas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1064" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

