yatúna, a., strebsam [von yat wie dharúṇa von dhar].<BR>-asya {398,8} asyá 〰 ketúnā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1081" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

