(yudhénya), yudhénia, a., zu bekämpfen [von yudh].<BR>-āni bhū́ri {946,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

