युध्म|युध्मः
yudhmá, m., Kämpfer [von yudh].<BR>-a {621,7} (indra).<BR>-ás von Indra: {55,2}. _{55,5}; {212,3}; {459,2}; {536,3} (anarvā́ khajakṛ́t).<BR>-ám {701,8} (índram).<BR>-ásya {280,1} (índrasya).<BR>-ā́s {320,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

