युध्वन्
yúdhvan, a. [von yudh], streitbar, kriegerisch.<BR>-ā jánas {800,5}; rā́jā {901,4}; (sómas) {778,16} (〰 sán).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

