rákṣaṇa, n., Schutz, Behütung [von 1. raks].<BR>-ebhis {299,14} rákṣā nas agne táva 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षस्
rakṣás, m., Bezeichnung einer Gattung nächtlicher Unholde, ursprünglich: Beschädiger [von 2. rakṣ]; vgl. a-rakṣás „nicht schädigend“ u. s. w., die Adj. ájuṣṭa, atrín, bhaṅgurā́vat.<BR>-ā́s {620,16} yás vā 〰 śúcir asmi‿íti ā́ha.<BR>-ásam {816,6} 〰 kám cid atríṇam.<BR>-áse {517,19}.<BR>-ásas [Ab.] pāhí nas agne 〰 {36,15}; {517,13}; ähnlich {669,10}; {783,1}.<BR>-ásas [G.] hantā́ {129,11} (pāpásya); ámīvās {249,1}; pā́jas {462,7}; sádāṃsi {803,4}; bálam {913,25} (yātudhā́nasya).<BR>-ásas [N.] tápurmūrdhā tapatu 〰 yé {1008,3}.<BR>-ásas [A.] {76,3}; {79,6}; {214,14}; {300,1}. _{300,15}; {437,2}; {620,7}. _{620,17}—_{620,19}. _{620,21}; {643,14}; {669,19}; {775,29}; {798,48}; {902,4}; {913,23}; in allen diesen Stellen werden die Götter aufgefordert, sie zu tödten, oder gepriesen, dass sie es gethan. Ferner {396,10} yás óhate 〰; {958,2} abhí siāma 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षस्
rákṣas, n. [von 2. rakṣ], 1〉 Beschädigung; 2〉 persönlich gefasst = rakṣás.<BR>-as 1〉 mā́ nas 〰 abhí naṭ yātumā́vatām {620,23}; mā́ nas 〰 ā́ veśīt ‥, mā́ yātús yātumā́vatām {669,20}. — 2〉 {21,5}; {86,9}; {133,5}; {264,16}. _{264,17}; {299,14}; {459,10}; {620,1}. _{620,4}. _{620,13}. _{620,22}; {765,1}; {809,10}; {913,10}. _{913,14}; {915,14}; {944,7}; {978,3}; wo überall die Götter aufgefordert werden, den Unhold zu tödten u. s. w.<BR>-asā {797,1} ápa‿ámīvā bhavatu 〰 sahá.<BR>-ase {356,9} 〰 viníkṣe. 10 〰 hántavaí; {503,9} gambhīrā́ya 〰 hetím asya.<BR>-āṃsi {79,12}; {457,29}. _{457,48}; {504,10}; {531,10}; {554,7}; {643,13}; {655,16}; {663,26}; {729,3}; {749,1}; {761,5}; {768,1}; {775,28}; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1132" target="_blank">Page1132</a>] {822,12} {862,4}; {913,9}. _{913,19}; {924,12}; {1013,3}.<BR>-obhyas [D.] 〰 vadhám asyatam {620,25}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षस्त्व|रक्षस्त्वं
(rakṣastvá), rakṣastuá, n., Beschädigung, Behexung [von rákṣas].<BR>-éna {638,13} yás nas kás cid rírikṣati 〰 mártias.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षस्तुअ
(rakṣastvá), rakṣastuá, n., Beschädigung, Behexung [von rákṣas].<BR>-éna {638,13} yás nas kás cid rírikṣati 〰 mártias.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षस्विन्
rakṣasvín, a. [von rákṣas], unhold, schädigend, zauberisch von Menschen, die mit den nächtlichen Unholden in Verbindung gedacht werden; häufig 2〉 substantivisch gebraucht.<BR>-ínam mártiam {610,12}.<BR>-ínā 2〉 {642,18} (ánādhṛṣṭam).<BR>-íne mártāya {669,8}. — 2〉 {667,12}.<BR>-ínas [A. p.] 2〉 {12,5} (neben ríṣatas); {36,20} (neben yātumā́vatas); {669,20}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षि
(rákṣi), a., hütend, schützend [von 1. rakṣ], in pathi-, paśu-rákṣi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षितृ
rakṣitṛ́, m., Beschützer, Hüter, Wächter [von 1. rakṣ]; insbesondere 2〉 mit dem Gen. des behüteten.<BR>-ā́ {89,5} (neben pāyús). — 2〉 amṛ́tasya {448,7}; sómasya {911,5}.<BR>-ā́ram 2〉 dúghānām {893,6}.<BR>-ā́rā [du.] 2〉 tanúas {230,6}.<BR>-ā́rau {840,11} (śvā́nau yamásya).<BR>-ā́ras {89,1} (devā́s).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षोयुज्
rakṣo-yúj, a., m., Gefährte [yúj] der nächtlichen Unholde [rákṣas].<BR>-úje {503,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

