raghupátma-jaṃhas, a., schnellfliegende Schwingen [jáṃhas] habend, leicht beschwingt.<BR>-ās {444,5} vés ná druṣádvā 〰.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघुपत्वन्
raghu-pátvan, a., schnell fliegend.<BR>-ā agnís {832,4} (devā́n áchā jigāti).<BR>-ānas sáptayas (marútām) {85,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघुमन्यु
raghu-manyu, a., schnellen, regsamen Eifer [manyú] besitzend.<BR>-avas [V.] {122,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रघुय्
√raghuy, rasch [raghú] dahineilen.<BR>Part. raghuyát:<BR>-át [n.] mahā́m ánīkam … raghuṣyád 〰 {301,9}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

