रयिषाह्
rayi-ṣā́h, a., Reichthum erringend od. besitzend [sā́h oder sáh von sah].<BR>-ā́t [N. s.] ámartias {58,3} (agnís); {780,8} (sómas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

