vadhū́, f., 1〉 Braut, junge Frau [von vah]; 2〉 Zugthier, Gespann [von vah]. — Adj.: ádhivastra, bhadrá, supéśas, sumaṅgalī́, suvā́sas.<BR>-ū́s [N. s.] 1〉 {391,3}; {646,13}; {853,12}; {911,33}.<BR>-úam 1〉 {933,9}.<BR>-úā 1〉 vām ráthas 〰 yā́damānas {585,3}.<BR>-úas [G.] 1〉 kā́mam {428,5}; vā́sasā {911,30}; vahatúm {911,31}.<BR>-úas [A. p.] 1〉 vṛ́ṣaṇas ‥ 〰 yanti ácha {401,6}.<BR>-ū́naam 2〉 pañcaśátam {639,36}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

