varatrā́, f. [von vṛ], Riemen, Seil.<BR>-áyā {886,8} yugám 〰 náhyanti.<BR>-ā́yām {928,8} 〰 ānáhyamānas.<BR>-ā́s [N. p.] {353,4} śunám badhyantām.<BR>-ā́s [A. p.] {927,5} sám dadhātana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1218" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

