varā́hu, m., dass.<BR>-um {121,11} (vṛtrám).<BR>-ūn {88,5} (áyodaṃṣṭrān).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1218" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

