vás, m. oder f., Wohnplatz, Haus [von 3. vas].<BR>-asā́m rā́jānam (agním) {356,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1233" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

