vāvā́ta, a. (P. vavā́ta, Prāt. 〔563〕) [von vā = van], lieb, werth.<BR>-ā [du.] vṛ́ṣaṇā hárī {624,14}.<BR>-ā [f.] gī́r {300,8} (te).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1262" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वावातृ
