वास्तु
vā́stu, n. [von 3. vas], Wohnstätte, Haus und Hof, Haus; vgl. su-vā́stu.<BR>-u {645,5} (ádhi kṣitas).<BR>-os [G.] mit dem Vok. pate verbunden 〰 pate {570,1}—_{570,3}; {571,1}; {637,14}.<BR>-os [G.] pátim {395,8}; {887,7}.<BR>-ūni vām {154,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1264" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

