वाह|वाहः
vāhá, a. m. [von vah], 1〉 a., bringend, fahrend, wegführend in uda-, yūpa-, ripra-vāhá; 2〉 m., Zugthier.<BR>-ā́s 2〉 {353,4}.<BR>-aís 2〉 {353,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1264" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

