viṃśatí, f., Schaar von Zwanzigen, zwanzig [Cu. 〔16〕; aus vi = dvi und verkürztem daśati (Zehnzahl), also = zweimal zehn].<BR>-ís {80,9}; saptá śatā́ni 〰 ca (720) {164,11} (putrā́s).<BR>-ím {912,23} (sasūva); gā́s {468,8}; ukṣṇás {912,14}; ékam ca 〰 ca (21) jánān {534,11}; úṣṭrānām 〰 śatā́ (2000) {666,22}. _{666,31} (úṣṭrān); catā́ ca 〰 ca (120) gónām {381,2}.<BR>-yā́ háribhis {209,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1266" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

