viṣṭārá, a., ausgedehnt(?) [von star m. ví].<BR>-ás {406,10} (die ausgedehnte Marutschaar).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1309" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टि|विष्टिः
viṣṭí, f., Arbeit, Bemühung [von 2. viṣ].<BR>-ī́ [I.] yúvānā pitárā púnar ṛbhávas 〰 akrata {20,4}.<BR>-íbhis {92,3} (nā́rīs apásas ná 〰).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1309" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टिर्
