वीड्
√vīḍ, nur im Causale 1〉 stark, fest machen; 2〉 me., sich stark erweisen, stark sein; 3〉 Part. II. stark, fest, parallel dṛḍhá. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1315" target="_blank">Page1315</a>]<BR>Stamm vīḍáya:<BR>-āsi [Co.] 1〉 yád 〰 vīḍú tád {665,6}.<BR>-asva 2〉 akṣa {287,19}; vanaspate {488,26}; dundubhe {488,30}.<BR>vīḍaya:<BR>-asvā 2〉 vanaspate {228,3}.<BR>Part. vīḍitá:<BR>-a 3〉 akṣa {287,19}.<BR>-ás 3〉 índras {212,4}.<BR>-ā́ [n.] 3〉 neben dṛḍhā́ {215,3}; {463,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1314" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीडु
vīḍú, a. [von vīḍ], 1〉 fest, haltbar; 2〉 stark, von Personen oder ihren Thaten; 3〉 n., die Feste, Burg. — Häufig parallel mit sthirá, dṛḍhá.<BR>-o 1〉 akṣa {287,19}.<BR>-ús ákṣas {287,17}.<BR>-úm 1〉 ádrim {871,6}.<BR>-ú [s.] 1〉 {6,5}; {127,3}; {915,6}; śárma {127,5}; áṃhas {299,14} (bildlich); tád {665,6}.<BR>-áve 1〉 {465,8}. — 2〉 agnáye {664,27}.<BR>-ós 2〉 ásunvatas {101,4}.<BR>-aú 3〉 yád 〰 vásu {665,41}; 〰 satī́s {265,5} (apás).<BR>-avas 1〉 ádrayas {697,3}.<BR>-ū [n. p.] 1〉 ā́yudhā {39,2}.<BR>-u [n. p.] 2〉 cyautnā́ni {686,9}. — 3〉 〰 cid dṛḍhā́ rujan {71,2}; {660,1} (sāhiṣīmáhi).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1315" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

