शद्
√śad [Fi. unter 2. kad], 1〉 prangen mit, sich auszeichnen durch [I.]; 2〉 vertrauen, sich verlassen auf [I.]; 3〉 herrlich, glücklich, siegreich sein, triumphiren.<BR>Perf. śāśad:<BR>-dús 3〉 yásmin purā́ vāvṛdhús 〰 ca {211,4}.<BR>-dmahe 2〉 tváyā vayám 〰 ráṇeṣu {946,5}.<BR>-dré [3. p. me.] 2〉 tváyā hí agne váruṇas mitrás 〰 aryamā́ {141,9}.<BR>Part. Perf. śā́śadāna:<BR>-as 3〉 índras {33,13}.<BR>-ā [du.] 3〉 vīḍupátmabhis āśuhémabhis vā devā́nam vā jūtíbhis 〰 {116,2}.<BR>-ān 2〉 tā́n bāhúbhis 〰 {614,4}.<BR>-ā [f.] 1〉 kaníā‿iva tanúā 〰 {123,10}; arepásā tanúā 〰 {124,6} (uṣā́s).<BR>-ām 2〉 māyáyā {620,24} (stríyam).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

