शाक|शाकं|शाकः
śāká, a., m., stark, hülfreich, Gehülfe (v. śak).<BR>-ás aruṇás suparṇás {881,6} (śā́kmanā).<BR>-é wol śā́ke zu lesen (BR.) {369,2}.<BR>-aís nṛ́bhis asya 〰 (marúdbhis) {313,11}; asya 〰 (marúdbhis) {384,10}; {460,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक|शाकं|शाकः
śā́ka, m., Kraft [von śak]; vgl. puru-śā́ka.<BR>-ās śácīvatas te puruśāka 〰 {465,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाकिन्
śākín, a., kräftig, stark [von śā́ka].<BR>-ínam índram {666,14}; {285,2}.<BR>-íne (índrāya) {54,2} (neben śakrā́ya, śácīvate); gáve ná {486,22}.<BR>-ínas [N. p.] saptá 〰 {406,17}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाकिन्
śā́kin, a., dass.<BR>-ī 〰 bhava yájamānasya coditā́ {51,8} (oder śākī́ zu lesen?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाकिन|शाकिनं
