शाखा
śā́khā, f., Ast, Zweig; vgl. dáśa-śākha.<BR>-ā pakvā́ {8,8}.<BR>-ām vṛkṣásya {920,3}.<BR>-ās [A. p.] vanínas [G.] {559,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाचिगु
