शिमीवत्|शिमीवन्त्
śímīvat, a., des Metrums wegen oft śímivat zu lesen ({216,3}; {410,3}; {834,2}; {141,13}), wirksam, regsam, kräftig vordringend [von śímī].<BR>-ān raváthas {100,13}; síndhus {216,3}; ṛ́kṣas ná vas marutas 〰 ámas {410,3}; vatsás (agnís) {834,2}.<BR>-ati krándasi {864,1}. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1395" target="_blank">Page1395</a>]<BR>-atos [G. du] {155,2} (samáraṇam).<BR>-antas yodhā́s {904,3}.<BR>-atas [A. p.] gā́s ṛtásya {84,16}.<BR>-adbhis arkaís {141,13}.<BR>-atām marútaām {640,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

