शिश्न|शिश्नं|शिश्नः
śiśná, n., Schwanz.<BR>-ā́ mū́ṣas ná 〰 ví adanti mā‿ādhías {105,8}; 〰 praminānás {853,19}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1396" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिश्नथ
