śúci-jihva, a., flammende Zunge [jihvā́] habend.<BR>-as agnís {200,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुचिदत्|शुचिदन्त्
śúci-dat, a., dessen Zahn [dát] die Flamme [śúci 9] ist, hellzahnig.<BR>-an agnís {520,2}; {361,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

