śuci-pā́, a., hellen, reinen Trank (Soma) trinkend.<BR>-ās [V.] vāyo {606,2}; {608,1}.<BR>-é [D.] vāyáve {926,2}.<BR>-ā [V. du.] indravāyū {607,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

