śúci-bhrāja, a., hellstrahlend [bhrājá].<BR>-ās [N. p. f.] uṣásas {79,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

