शुभ्
śúbh, f., 1〉 Glanz, Pracht; 2〉 Dat. oder Acc. in infinitivem Sinne: um sich zu schmücken, einmal von uṣas ({347,6}), sonst von den Maruts, die sich in der Gewitterwolke mit glänzender Waffenrüstung schmücken; 3〉 pl., Schmuck, Zierath an Ross und Wagen.<BR>-úbham 1〉 {503,4}. — 2〉 mit Verben der Bewegung (yā, car, i) {23,11}; {347,6}; {409,1}; {411,2}; {598,5}.<BR>-ubhā́ 1〉 〰 śóbhiṣṭhās {572,6}; mimikṣus {165,1}.<BR>-ubhé 2〉 {64,4}; {87,3}; {88,2}; {117,5}; {119,3}; {127,6}; {167,6}; {260,4}; {406,8}; {411,3}; {417,5}; {504,6}; {573,3}; {603,5}; {604,3}; {646,13}; {931,3}.<BR>-ubhás [G.] siehe śubhás páti.<BR>-úbhas [N. p.] 3〉 ráthe {408,11}; vājíni {806,1}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुभंया
śubhaṃ-yā́, a., zum Schmucke [śúbham Acc. von śúbh] eilend [yā́ von yā].<BR>-é [D.] vā́tāya prátavase 〰 {299,6} [vgl. śúbham mit yā].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुभंयावन्
śubhaṃ-yā́van, a., dass.<BR>-ā mā́rutas gaṇás {415,13}.<BR>-ānas marútas {89,7}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुभंयु|शुभंयुः
śubhaṃyú, m., dass.<BR>-ávas (marútas) {904,7} (uṣásām ná ketávas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभस्पति
śubhás-páti, m., nur im Dual Herren des Glanzes oder Schmuckes [siehe śúbh], überall von den Aśvinen.<BR>-ī [Vo. śubhas patī] {3,1}; {34,6}; {47,5}; {120,6}; {429,8}; {625,11}; {642,4}. _{642,6}; {696,5}; {866,4}. _{866,12}. _{866,13}; {911,15}; {957,4}; {1028,3}. _{1028,5}.<BR>-ī [N. A.] {625,5}; {642,14}; {646,6}; {866,14}; {919,6}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुभाय्
√śubhāy, glänzen [von śubh Denominativbildung].<BR>-yate eṣá devás ádhi yónau 〰 {740,3}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुभ्र|शुभ्रं|शुभ्रः
śubhrá, a., glänzend, schimmernd, schmuck [von śubh]; auch 2〉 bildlich als Beiwort der Kraft.<BR>-a (agne) {359,4}.<BR>-ás (índras) {202,4}; máryas ná {808,20} (sómas); 〰 ná yúvā {726,5} (sómas). — 2〉 śúṣmas {572,8}.<BR>-ám [m.] vájram {202,4}; agním {260,2}; sómam [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1407" target="_blank">Page1407</a>] {819,24} — 2〉 śúṣmam {202,4}.<BR>-ám [n.] ándhas {774,5}.<BR>-ā [V. du.] aśvinā {584,1}; {969,3}.<BR>-ā́bhyām háribhyām {35,3}.<BR>-ās [V. p. m.] (marutas) {627,2}. _{627,14}.<BR>-ā́s [m.] marútas {167,4}; {572,16} śíśavas ná; {19,5}; {85,3}; {627,25}. _{627,28}; devā́s {555,3}; índavas {775,26}.<BR>-ā́sas (marútas) {227,2}.<BR>-ébhis aṃśúbhis {727,5}; (marúdbhis) {778,26}.<BR>-e [V. s. f.] sarasvati {611,6}; {612,2}; uṣas {57,3}.<BR>-ā́ [f.] uṣā́s {434,5}; {591,6}.<BR>-e [V. du. f.] (vipāś, cutudri) {267,2}.<BR>-é [N. du. f.] gā́vā‿iva (vipā́ś, śutudrī́) {267,1}.<BR>-ā́s [N. p. f.] uṣásas {347,6}; etā́s {202,3}; ā́pas púras ná {395,12}; nadías {396,12}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

