śū́ra-grāma, a., von Helden umschart [grā́ma Schar].<BR>-as (sómas) {802,3} 〰 sarvávīras sáhavān jétā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

