शूष|शूषः
śūṣá, a., m. [von 2. śuṣ], ursprünglich „schnaufend“, daher 1〉 kräftig vordringend; 2〉 laut ertönend vom Liede; 3〉 m., das lautertönende Lied, Preislied; 4〉 m., Kraft, Macht. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1412" target="_blank">Page1412</a>]<BR>-ás 1〉 kṛṣṭihā́‿iva (sómas) {783,2}.<BR>-ám [m.] 2〉 stómam {451,2}; ghóṣam {241,6}. — 3〉 {9,10}; {62,1}; {288,1}; {541,5}; {922,2}; {946,8}; {959,1}. — 4〉 suvitásya {857,3}.<BR>-ám [n.] 2〉 mánma {154,3} (wo śuuṣám zu sprechen); {880,6}.<BR>-ásya 3〉 mánmabhis {683,1}; dhurí {131,2}.<BR>-é [du. n.] 1〉 vádhatre {809,54}.<BR>-ébhis 2〉 arkaís {832,4}.<BR>-aís 1〉 sátvabhis {283,2}. — 3〉 {395,7}; {509,3}; {832,3}; gṛṇīté agnís etárī ná 〰 {395,10}; {453,4} (agnís stave).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

