शृङ्ग|शृंग|शृंगं|शृङ्गं|शृङ्गः
śṛ́ṅga, n., Horn [Boppʼs Ableitung aus śiramga d. h. „auf dem Kopfe befindlich“ ist wol die richtige, ga [von gam] in dem Sinne „befindlich“ siehe 1. ga 2〉 bei BR.]. Vgl. cátuḥśṛṅga^1 u. s. w.<BR>-am gávām iva {413,3}; ṛtásya {695,5}.<BR>-e [du.] śíśānas {669,13}; {717,2}; {782,7}; {799,7}; śíśīte {356,9}.<BR>-āṇi táva {163,11}; śṛṅgínām {242,10}; 〰 dódhuvat śíśīte {727,4}.<BR>-ā {230,3}; {140,6} (davidhāva); {354,3} (catvā́ri asya).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Marcis Gasuns on 20210731. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

