श्वेत|श्वेतं|श्वेतः
śvetá, a., weiss, licht, hell, glänzend [v. śvit]; insbesondere 2〉 Beiwort des weissen Rosses, welches die Aśvinen dem Pedu schenkten; auch 3〉 bildlich vom Gebete; 4〉 m., Leuchte(?).<BR>-ás vājī́ (agnís) {355,4}; drapsás ná {603,6}; (vāyús) {607,3}; yā́mas asya (agnés) {846,9}. — 4〉 〰 ná vikṣú {66,6} (agnís).<BR>-ám [m.] áśvam {593,3}; agním {235,4}; (vāyúm) {606,3}; kaláśam {323,5}; {786,8}. — 2〉 áśvam {116,6}; {118,9}; {119,10}; {865,10}.<BR>-ám [n.] rūpám {786,7}.<BR>-aú [du.] (indrāgnī́) {660,8}.<BR>-ā́ [dass.] vicakṣaṇā́ {661,9}.<BR>-ā́sas ukṣáṇas {1024,2}.<BR>-ā́n ádhinirṇijas {661,10} (Gegensatz kṛṣṇā́n).<BR>-áyā 3〉 dhiyā́ {646,19}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

