sadha-mā́da, m., 1〉 Genossenschaft m. Gen.; 2〉 Trinkgelage, gemeinsames Gelage beim Opferfeste; 3〉 Festgenosse; 4〉 -am mad an gleichem Mahle sich erfreuen mit [I.].<BR>-am 1〉 {319,2} kás asya vīrás 〰 āpa. — 2〉 {548,1}; {622,28}; {914,17}. — 4〉 yaména {840,10}; tṛtī́ye nā́ke AV. 6,122,4.<BR>-e 2〉 {269,4}; {277,3} (mádhūnām); {538,3}; {622,3}; {774,6}; {861,10}; {922,12}. — 3〉 índre {30,13} (Sāy.).<BR>-eṣu 2〉 {51,8}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1463" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सधमाद्य
(sadhamā́dya), sadhamā́dia, a., zum gemeinsamen Opfermahle [sadhamā́da] gehörig, daher 2〉 an dem gemeinsamen Opfermahle Theil habend, Fest- oder Tischgenosse.<BR>-as (sómas) {735,6}. — 2〉 āpís nas {623,1}; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1464" target="_blank">Page1464</a>] bhávā nas 〰 {706,7} (SV. falsch -e); nas bodhi {1023,5}.<BR>-ā [du.] 2〉 hárī {633,27}; {652,29}; {702,24}.<BR>-āsas 2〉 mánuṣas {930,4}.<BR>-āni ukthā́ {299,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1463" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

