sanítra, n., Spende, Gabe [von san].<BR>-am {809,29} índo 〰 divás ā́ pavasva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1469" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

