sarít, f., Fluss, Bach [von sṛ].<BR>-ítas [N. p.] sravanti 〰 ná dhénās {354,6}.<BR>-ítas [A.] {586,2} neben samudrā́n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1488" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

