सर्पिरन्न
sarpír-anna, a., zerlassene Butter [sarpís] zur Speise [ánna] habend, Schmalz essend.<BR>-as savitā́ {853,18}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1489" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्पिरासुति|सर्पिरासुतिः
sarpír-āsuti, a., dessen Trank [1. āsutí] zerlassene Butter [sarpís] ist, Schmelzbutter schlürfend.<BR>-e [V.] agne {361,9}; {375,2}.<BR>-is (agnís) {198,6}; {895,2}.<BR>-im mitrám ná {683,2} (agním).<BR>-ī [du.] samrā́jā (mitrā́váruṇā) {649,9}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1489" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

