sarpís, n., zerlassene Butter, Schmelzbutter, Schmalz [von sṛp].<BR>-ís {779,32} (kṣīrám 〰 mádhu‿udakám).<BR>-íṣā {844,7} (ā́ñjanena).<BR>-íṣas [G.] víbhrāṣṭim {127,1} (ājúhvānasya); dárvī {360,9} (śrīṇīṣe).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1489" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

