सुउक्त
sūktá, su-uktá, a., n., 1〉 a., schön gesprochen [uktá Part. II. v. vac]; 2〉 n., schöner Spruch, Hymne, Lied. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1563" target="_blank">Page1563</a>]<BR>Form sūktá:<BR>-ám 1〉 bráhma {891,14}.<BR>-éna 1〉 vácasā {209,3}. — 2〉 {171,1}; {197,2}; {493,17}.<BR>-ā́ya 1〉 vácase {802,6}. — 2〉 {721,8}.<BR>-ásya 2〉 yantā́ {214,19}.<BR>-ā́ni 2〉 {93,1}; {664,2}.<BR>-ébhis 1〉 vácobhis {399,4}.<BR>-aís 2〉 {42,10}; {403,2}; {436,7}.<BR>Form suuktá:<BR>-ám 2〉 {574,6}.<BR>-ā́ya 2〉 {803,5}.<BR>-ébhis 1〉 vácobhis {36,1}.<BR>-aís 2〉 {70,5}; {545,3}; {581,1}; {582,12}; {584,9}; {887,26}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1562" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्तवाक
