sū́ra, m., Sonne [vgl. súar]; im neunten Buche (_{713,1}—?{_826,1}) werden die hellen Somatropfen der Sonne verglichen oder gleichgesetzt; vgl. Ku. 〔16,184 fg.〕<BR>-as {50,9}; {66,1}; {71,9}; {121,6}. _{121,7}. _{121,10}; {122,15}; {130,9}; {141,13}; {174,5}; {341,6}; {433,9}; {443,6}; {444,3}; {489,17}; {519,6} (citrás); {561,2}; {626,25}; {627,36}; {778,18}. _{778,22} (viśvádarśatas); {798,34}; {803,3}; {823,1}; {947,6}; {958,6}; {1005,2}; {1025,5}.<BR>-as [dreisilbig] {492,2}; {149,3}.<BR>-am {86,5}; {777,1}; {779,9}.<BR>-āya {50,2} (viśvácakṣase).<BR>-āt {163,2}.<BR>-e {34,5} (〰 duhitā́); {472,1} (toké apsú tánaye ca 〰); {809,38} (úpa 〰 ná dhā́tā?); 〰 údite {249,2}; {579,5}; {581,1}; {582,4}. _{582,7}. _{582,12}; {621,29}; {633,13}; {647,21}.<BR>-ās (sómāsas) {722,5}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1566" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूरचक्षस्
