सेतु|सेतुः
sétu, m. [von 1. si] 1〉 Band, Fessel; 2〉 eine aus Stricken gebildete Vorrichtung zum Festhalten der Menschen oder Thiere; 3〉 Brücke.<BR>-us 1〉 mā́ nas 〰 siṣet ayám {676,8}.<BR>-um 3〉 suvitásya áti 〰 durāvíam {753,2}.<BR>-au 2〉 tíṣṭhantīs (gā́s) ánṛtasya 〰 {893,4}.<BR>-ū [du.] 2〉 bhū́ripāśau ánṛtasya 〰 duratyétū ripáve mártiāya {581,3}.<BR>-avas 2〉 padé-pade pāśínas santi 〰 {785,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1578" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

