sthirá-pīta, a., sicher geschützt [pīta von 1. pā, vgl. nṛpīti].<BR>-am {897,5} utá tvam sakhyé 〰 áhus, ná‿enam hinvanti ápi vā́jineṣu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1604" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

