स्मद्दिष्टि
smád-diṣṭi, a., mit Lenkung versehen, 1〉 gut lenkend; 2〉 gut zu lenken.<BR>-is 1〉 (índras) {279,5}.<BR>-ī 2〉 dāsā́ {888,10}.<BR>-ayas 2〉 ṛjrā́sas {534,23}.<BR>-īn 2〉 hiraṇínas (áśvān) {504,9}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1614" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

