स्वध्वर
(svadhvará), su-adhvará, a., n. [von adhvará], 1〉 a., schön opfernd, von Agni, 2〉 von Menschen; 3〉 schöne Opferfeier empfangend, von Göttern; 4〉 zur Opferfeier geeignet; 5〉 n., schönes Opfer, gute Opferfeier, stets mit kṛ (veranstalten) verbunden. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1625" target="_blank">Page1625</a>]<BR>-a 1〉 {44,8}; {382,5}; {643,5}.<BR>-ás 1〉 {127,1}; {193,8}; {639,24}; {712,12}; {837,5}; {941,2}. — 2〉 mártas {639,5}; kīrís {712,13}. — 4〉 sómas {798,7}; {715,8}.<BR>-ám 1〉 {236,8}; {243,8}; {363,3}; {456,4}; {457,40}; {532,1}; {660,11}. — 3〉 jánam {45,1}; {625,33}. — 4〉 rátham {342,4}.<BR>-é 4〉 yajñé {142,5}; {664,13}; sóme {1019,5}. — 5〉 kṛté 〰 {371,1}.<BR>-ā́sas 1〉 agnáyas {341,5}.<BR>-ā́ [n.] 5〉 {240,6}; {263,12}; {451,1}; {533,3}. _{533,4}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1624" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुअध्वर
