हेति|हेतिः
hetí, f., Wurfwaffe, etwa Lanze [von hi]; 2〉 Anprall, Andrang; 3〉 Eile, schnelles Dahinjagen, Lauf.<BR>-ís rud(a)rásya {224,14}; {469,7}; vivásvatas {676,20}; te (índrasya) {915,12}; pakṣíṇī {991,2}. _{991,3}.<BR>-ím von as (werfen) abhängig: {103,3}; {121,10}; {264,17}; {493,3}; {503,9}. — 2〉 jyā́yās {516,14}; te (agnés) {968,3}.<BR>-ī́ [I.] {459,10} (Pada falsch hetís).<BR>-yā́s [Ab.] te (índrasya) {913,19}.<BR>-áyas asya (índrasya) {1019,2} (śatā́nīkās); 3〉 mṛgā́ṇām {190,4}.<BR>-ī́s [A. p.] ádevias (geschrieben ádevīs) {670,10}.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=GRA&page=1680" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=gra" target="_blank">Correction</a>

